{"type":"bridge-session","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","bridgeSessionId":"cse_01D7CJmXuD2ASqfBYm7Lk4WZ","lastSequenceNum":18951,"ownerAccountUuid":"138d593e-e185-4f72-89f2-82e1a501f134","ownerOrganizationUuid":"602db9b4-428d-49e6-a99c-64152cc62a79"}
{"parentUuid":"1fc78e26-49a5-4735-9e2e-5d110a579677","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgPJ21J3EBbaf4WqfpG9i","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The `lazy-tail` fork is running with a cap of about 70 tool calls. It does four things:\n\n1. **Measures first.**\n   - It counts dependency-layer growths, memo hits and misses, and time in growth against time in resolve over a 50-component sequence on Spectrum and Chakra.\n   - Its job is to confirm or refute my hypothesis: that each layer growth replaces the resolution context and throws away its memos.\n2. **Fixes the cause if the hypothesis holds.**\n   - The fork picks the simpler sound option: either load the project's whole dependency demand set once, at the first request, so the layer never grows again, or make a growth keep the memos whose reads it doesn't touch.\n   - The target is the lazy total near eager's (0.3–0.4 s on Spectrum) while keeping the first story at about 150 ms and peak memory no worse than today's lazy.\n3. **Keeps correctness.** Results must match batch exactly (`lazy_parity` and the Storybook harness answers), and it needs an exact-value test that a request sequence causes at most one growth or that memos survive growth.\n4. **Reports the real cause if I'm wrong,** found with a profile, even if it can't be fixed in the cap.\n\nOpen PRs: #196 (LSP removal), #197 (`fillAfter`, off by default) and #160 (release). Issue #1 (presets) still needs your decision."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6848,"cache_read_input_tokens":613365,"output_tokens":463,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6848,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":463,"cache_read_input_tokens":613365,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6848,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6848},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"7c701ff6-382b-4254-863c-732bfb8eebec","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgPJ1zsk1U7wZQqsWfGmL","requestRef":"c003ab9b-ee3b-4352-b767-7b1d62978dca","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"ebc59680-d486-4123-aaeb-828352fba642","timestamp":"2026-10-25T16:46:11.354Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","version":"2.1.308","gitBranch":"feat/addon-fill-after","slug":"purring-snuggling-matsumoto"}
