r caliper-docgen-storybook build for each checkout): fallback rate, answered counts, first story, total, median, peak RSS, extra/missing props, default and control-kind differences vs react-component-meta. Compare with the numbers from the start of this session where you can (mantine/chakra/shadcn/antd/spectrum: 19-89x faster than RDT, 3-6x less memory, same-Storybook-control 86-100%, exact text 19-78%, real recall Mantine 89%/Chakra 79%/shadcn 98%/antd 85%/Spectrum 98%, fallback rates 70/56-92/46/42/38%) and say what improved, what did not, and anything that regressed. Be explicit about caveats (sample sizes, machine, warm vs cold). Output: a markdown report at /Users/gabe/.claude/jobs/ba6a68d6/tmp/compare-rdt.md plus a summary in your final message with the key tables. If all numbers are clean, open a non-draft PR (base main) updating docs/performance.md and the README speed/quality claims with the new measured numbers and the date, with a changeset only if shipped text requires one, `just lint doc-check machete typos` exit code read directly. Time-box ~70 tool calls. Commits end with Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/REDACTED; PR body ends with https://claude.ai/code/REDACTED; never push main/force-push/merge; /usr/bin/git with sandbox off, one plain git command per call."}},"serverClassifierRequest":"80a38a31-dc7b-4da0-b91c-49945a51116a","apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011CgPQoLPCvv6u1jEKNVvGW","requestRef":"b54b2387-fdd7-4bfa-a502-ea4f3a444413","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"5396c909-0663-4a25-94e7-9ab02a12936b","timestamp":"2026-10-25T18:15:45.610Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","version":"2.1.308","gitBranch":"perf/lazy-session-whole-demand","slu