{"type":"api-request","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","id":"dda3e5b6-df6d-442d-8f12-45b9ed7fed1c","timestamp":"2026-10-25T18:15:48.787Z","version":"2.1.308","querySource":"repl_main_thread:outputStyle:Concise","shapeHash":"695ec5a8802936862d1cd8c71e730e293e4e9e400bcbffb95f0146470866b732","params":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","betas":["claude-code-20250219","oauth-2025-04-20","interleaved-thinking-2025-05-14","thinking-token-count-2026-05-13","context-management-2025-06-27","prompt-caching-scope-2026-01-05","per-turn-control-2026-07-01","mid-conversation-tool-changes-2026-07-01","inline-tools-2026-09-15","advisor-tool-2026-03-01","advanced-tool-use-2025-11-20","mid-conversation-system-clear-at-2026-08-21","effort-2025-11-24","dangerous-tool-use-2026-09-03","thinking-binding-controls-2026-08-01","thinking-display-updates-2026-08-18","afk-mode-2026-01-31","extended-cache-ttl-2025-04-11","cache-diagnosis-2026-04-07","message-threads-2026-08-12"],"max_tokens":128000,"thinking":{"type":"adaptive","display":"updates"},"context_management":{"edits":[{"type":"clear_thinking_20251015","keep":"all"}]},"output_config":{"effort":"medium"}},"base":"b54b2387-fdd7-4bfa-a502-ea4f3a444413","keep":766,"tail":["4d0b96e0b0273850165204f8fe155d0b4f4ad2a94b857f74673174e1cb605e9d","e0b80c74dfaab5b369e3c0a1059cc13449c3a59487cebccce805830528187965","e32f7a5f279f66862ac3ec7b2fe8076d1f241d41bbc88609167da0dfe8cfea0c"],"cacheControl":[{"path":["system",1],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h","scope":"global"}},{"path":["system",2],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}},{"path":["messages",768,"content",0],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}}],"requestDigest":"20e98effc839458ffc8fe182c721f5391a10c7eb709b8d700c8d55ff494b637d"}
{"parentUuid":"ca45488a-54b7-451e-abd3-d096505cbc8b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgPQrkPRnY3f6H7KzSTb6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The `compare-rdt` fork is running with a cap of about 70 tool calls. It measures on a quiet machine, so please don't start other heavy jobs until it finishes.\n\n**What it measures**\n- **Speed against RDT.** Wall time and peak memory for RDT against caliper's CLI (default, and with dependencies and full HTML attributes in RDT format), cold and warm, best of N, interleaved. It also covers the lazy session's first-component and 10- and 50-component latency.\n- **Quality against RDT**, using the agreed semantics (quote, parenthesis and `Array<T>` differences are not meaningful):\n  - Components found, with hooks, contexts and helpers excluded.\n  - Prop recall and the same Storybook control per shared prop.\n  - Meaningful type disagreements, classed as wrong, less precise, opaque or more precise.\n  - Props we report that RDT doesn't, plus defaults and descriptions.\n  - The TS 7.1 oracle score.\n- **Storybook level.** The parity harness against react-component-meta for `main` and the #198 build: fallback rate, first story, total, median, peak memory, and missing or extra props.\n\nIt compares every figure with the start-of-session numbers (19–89× faster, 3–6× less memory, recall Mantine 89% through Spectrum 98%, fallback 38–92%) and states what improved, what didn't and what regressed. It writes the full report to `/Users/gabe/.claude/jobs/ba6a68d6/tmp/compare-rdt.md`. If everything is clean it opens a PR updating the speed and quality claims in `docs/performance.md` and the README with the new numbers and date.\n\nStill open and waiting on you: #196 (LSP removal), #197 (`fillAfter`, off by default), #198 (lazy whole-demand load), #160 (release), and issue #1. I'd merge #198 before the fork reports if you can accept shadcn's +70 MB, since the comparison is more meaningful against code that has landed."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6755,"cache_read_input_tokens":627038,"output_tokens":666,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6755,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":666,"cache_read_input_tokens":627038,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6755,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6755},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"89c62cb3-cf72-4338-a928-f98a9719c901","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgPQrjrBda4sUSAAwKgAw","requestRef":"dda3e5b6-df6d-442d-8f12-45b9ed7fed1c","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"de2f1418-2151-4093-8c9e-c997f35f20d4","timestamp":"2026-10-25T18:16:01.406Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","version":"2.1.308","gitBranch":"perf/lazy-session-whole-demand","slug":"purring-snuggling-matsumoto"}
