{"parentUuid":"b064fa24-670f-46d9-b052-926b1278a64a","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"fb1cbdc2-bf79-4cd7-a896-0109a40e4075","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01C1NTyS5YzYTFFwB7EYhKiB","type":"tool_result","content":"19:- [10. Load dependency declarations by name, before resolution, into a shared layer](0010-load-dependency-declarations-by-name.md) — do not load dependency files by import closure, resolve against them lazily during resolution, or emit their components or enums. Its precedence of shortcuts over dependency declarations is superseded by 0014.\n23:- [14. A loaded declaration wins over a known shortcut; shortcuts are fallbacks](0014-declarations-before-shortcuts.md) — do not check a shortcut before a declaration, or add one without measuring it against the declaration on consumer code.\n24:- [15. A member read through React's types reads React's declaration and what it imports](0015-member-reads-of-react-types-read-their-declarations.md) — do not answer an indexed access from a table before its declaration, or add React's own files to the dependency layer. Narrows 0013's \"only HTML-attribute lookups read the React index\" and 0010's \"the loader doesn't read React\".\n25:- [16. Resolve components on request, and load dependencies for the names their resolution reaches](0016-resolve-components-on-request.md) — do not make a lazy answer differ from batch extraction's for the same key, memoize a resolution that found a dependency name missing, or expose a parser type from the session API. Extends 0010's loading from \"before resolution\" to \"before the resolution that answers\".\n26:- [17. Version the canonical JSON, and make readers reject a version they don't read](0017-version-the-canonical-json.md) — do not change the canonical JSON's shape without bumping `SCHEMA_VERSION`, or let a reader accept a version it was not written for.\n27:- [18. Write prop sets and name lists once in the canonical output](0018-canonical-output-interns-prop-sets-and-name-lists.md) — do not write a component's props, an inheritance layer's `omitted` or a diagnostic's `affects` inline in canonical JSON. Extends 0009's per-prop table to the lists that repeat across components; `SCHEMA_VERSION` 2.\n     134","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"5baa7bf8-1cb9-41f4-98b2-f773985fefd2","timestamp":"2026-10-25T18:17:46.240Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"19:- [10. Load dependency declarations by name, before resolution, into a shared layer](0010-load-dependency-declarations-by-name.md) — do not load dependency files by import closure, resolve against them lazily during resolution, or emit their components or enums. Its precedence of shortcuts over dependency declarations is superseded by 0014.\n23:- [14. A loaded declaration wins over a known shortcut; shortcuts are fallbacks](0014-declarations-before-shortcuts.md) — do not check a shortcut before a declaration, or add one without measuring it against the declaration on consumer code.\n24:- [15. A member read through React's types reads React's declaration and what it imports](0015-member-reads-of-react-types-read-their-declarations.md) — do not answer an indexed access from a table before its declaration, or add React's own files to the dependency layer. Narrows 0013's \"only HTML-attribute lookups read the React index\" and 0010's \"the loader doesn't read React\".\n25:- [16. Resolve components on request, and load dependencies for the names their resolution reaches](0016-resolve-components-on-request.md) — do not make a lazy answer differ from batch extraction's for the same key, memoize a resolution that found a dependency name missing, or expose a parser type from the session API. Extends 0010's loading from \"before resolution\" to \"before the resolution that answers\".\n26:- [17. Version the canonical JSON, and make readers reject a version they don't read](0017-version-the-canonical-json.md) — do not change the canonical JSON's shape without bumping `SCHEMA_VERSION`, or let a reader accept a version it was not written for.\n27:- [18. Write prop sets and name lists once in the canonical output](0018-canonical-output-interns-prop-sets-and-name-lists.md) — do not write a component's props, an inheritance layer's `omitted` or a diagnostic's `affects` inline in canonical JSON. Extends 0009's per-prop table to the lists that repeat across components; `SCHEMA_VERSION` 2.\n     134","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"dangerouslyDisableSandbox":true},"classifierBoundary":true,"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"71447c6a-b034-4f3d-a900-f220509d12e0","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","root":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","branch":"chore/remove-lsp-scaffold","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/caliper","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/caliper","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/caliper","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","platform":"macos"}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"b064fa24-670f-46d9-b052-926b1278a64a","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"session_id":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","version":"2.1.308","gitBranch":"perf/lazy-session-whole-demand","slug":"purring-snuggling-matsumoto"}
