{"parentUuid":"e45ece0a-8496-40f5-8a43-beda44ad23df","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgPR6eoT5giEodLyXNQGR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01H7aXdyyRFqtUSo2dWgFMzj","name":"Agent","input":{"description":"Remaining antd gaps and empty-string default","subagent_type":"fork","isolation":"worktree","name":"antd-gaps","prompt":"Track AC: close the remaining Storybook-parity accuracy gaps. Branch off origin/main (PRs #196-#199 are open and unrelated; PR base `main`). Work through, TypeScript-minded (one resolution path, then read; see docs/architecture/resolver-type-resolution.md, ADRs 0010/0014/0015, AGENTS.md non-negotiables incl. always emit a Diagnostic when degrading) and with exact-value tests: (1) antd props Storybook's docgen lists that we lack (harness: node packages/storybook/scripts/storybook-parity.mjs --corpora /Users/gabe/.claude/jobs/ba6a68d6/tmp/bench-corpus --only antd --limit 100 --out <file>, after `pnpm --filter caliper-docgen-napi build:napi` and `pnpm --filter caliper-docgen-storybook build`): earlier 51 props in 8 stories: `PurePanel` 33, `Col` breakpoints 7, `CheckableTagGroup` 5, `Progress` aria props 2, and `ref` on 3 components: find what Storybook lists and why we drop it (inherited from a dependency type, HTML/aria attributes of a wrapped element, `forwardRef` ref prop, a mapped/utility type), and fix the generic causes; (2) Spectrum `Avatar.alt`: our output carries `''` as the default but Storybook's side still reports a difference: find whether the loss is in extraction or in how the addon (packages/storybook/src/arg-types.ts) handles an empty-string default and fix; (3) shadcn control-kind mismatches left after #188 (18 of 343 shared props, 5.2%): classify again with the harness, fix real losses (z.infer-based types are a known out-of-scope gap needing the checker: leave and keep documented), and the arg-types conversion cases; (4) report before/after harness counts for antd/shadcn/spectrum (defaults only Storybook lists, props Storybook lists that we lack, control-kind differences). Gates: `just equivalence` diffs explained (put intended differences in scripts/equivalence-allow.json with this PR; the list is empty on main, PR #199 empties it), `just equivalence --oracle` no regression, lazy parity, cache schema bump + golden test if SourceData changes, `just lint doc-check machete typos` and `cargo nextest run --workspace --exclude caliper-docgen-napi --locked` exit codes read directly (never pipe through tail), CI green, changeset. Do not touch crates/core/src/pipeline/revision/lazy.rs or named_type_index.rs (fork cheap-context owns them). Time-box ~80 tool calls. Commits end with Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/REDACTED; PR bodies end with https://claude.ai/code/REDACTED; never push main/force-push/merge; /usr/bin/git with sandbox off, one plain git command per call."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1409,"cache_read_input_tokens":644018,"output_tokens":3326,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":604},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1409,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":3326,"cache_read_input_tokens":644018,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1409,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1409},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.2.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"}],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01H7aXdyyRFqtUSo2dWgFMzj":{"description":"Remaining antd gaps and empty-string default","subagent_type":"fork","isolation":"wor