{"parentUuid":"b97a4d0c-3176-4a75-ad84-61efd27a3dbd","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgPRyftsAbx6zZntE2htU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01BSwBQvr47V1pvCeCgTPcp8","name":"WebFetch","input":{"url":"https://orin-dx.com/tools/caliper/","prompt":"List every quantitative or comparative claim about caliper vs react-docgen-typescript (RDT) or other tools: speed multiples, memory, accuracy/quality numbers, benchmark corpora, versions, dates. Quote the exact wording and numbers. Also list any feature claims (Storybook integration, LSP, presets, TS version, etc.)."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":693,"cache_read_input_tokens":656528,"output_tokens":202,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":693,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":202,"cache_read_input_tokens":656528,"cache_creation_input_tokens":693,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":693},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01BSwBQvr47V1pvCeCgTPcp8":{"url":"https://orin-dx.com/tools/caliper/","prompt":"List every quantitative or comparative claim about caliper vs react-docgen-typescript (RDT) or other tools: speed multiples, memory, accuracy/quality numbers, benchmark corpora, versions, dates. Quote the exact wording and numbers. Also list any feature claims (Storybook integration, LSP, presets, TS version, etc.)."}},"serverClassifierRequest":"54b5a521-b589-4de3-a6bb-40b5fd9c0beb","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgPRyfWJRQCxDLMQToXtZ","requestRef":"c23e95ba-abcb-4bcf-8fe0-fd20f1acef03","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"8132fef7-9a9a-400f-b08b-21a766f708d4","timestamp":"2026-10-25T18:30:33.185Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","version":"2.1.308","gitBranch":"perf/shared-index-on-growth","slug":"purring-snuggling-matsumoto"}
{"parentUuid":"8132fef7-9a9a-400f-b08b-21a766f708d4","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"f6064382-4e45-4a5e-9a71-e96233b0363a","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BSwBQvr47V1pvCeCgTPcp8","type":"tool_result","content":"## Quantitative and comparative claims\n\n**Speed (Caliper vs. RDT and react-docgen)**\n- Cold run, shared Node harness: Caliper 2.96 s, react-docgen 3.39 s, RDT 10.37 s. Apple Silicon Mac, 21 component libraries, 10 runs, July 2026.\n- Caliper binary alone, whole corpus: 50.5 ms cold run, 48 runs, same machine and month.\n- Single-file update: about 2 ms. The page also gives 1.74 to 2.13 ms across three fixtures.\n- The page says the Node harness time is mostly Node startup that all three tools pay.\n- Problem statement: \"On a design system that takes seconds, and every edit pays it again.\"\n- Comparison table lists RDT and react-docgen as having \"No incremental API.\"\n\n**Accuracy and coverage**\n- On 33 test components, Caliper misses 2,720 of RDT's props. 2,696 come from 10 components that need a type checker, and 24 are `ref` and `key`.\n- antd's Button: 312 props in Caliper vs. 313 in RDT.\n- Prototype TS 7.1 backend: same props as RDT on 13 components, with none missing or extra, including the 10 above.\n- Template literal types expand up to 4,096 values before becoming opaque.\n\n**Versions and dates**\n- Benchmarks used RDT 2.2.2 and react-docgen 7.1.1. They have not been re-run since July 2026.\n- Build requires Rust 1.94 or later.\n- TS 7.1 beta is expected 2026-10-06; stable is expected 2026-11-24. The page says these are TypeScript's dates.\n\n**Other numeric or behavioral details**\n- `check` exits 2 on errors and 1 on warnings with `--strict`.\n- `.d.ts` caching is keyed by content in `node_modules/.cache`.\n- `@types/react` is parsed once per run.\n\n## Feature claims\n\n**Integrations**\n- Storybook: output only (`__docgenInfo`), with no addon or preset.\n- Language server: starts but answers no hover requests. Prop hovers are planned.\n- Vite plugin: HMR updates, works in `vite build` and `--watch`.\n- Node binding: incremental sessions, returns canonical JSON only.\n- Rust plugin hooks: built, Rust only.\n\n**TypeScript and type-checker support**\n- The TS 7.1 backend is opt-in and planned. The TypeScript client is built but not connected.\n- No type checker is used. Conditional types, `infer`, and mapped types over generics come out opaque.\n- Caliper reads `.d.ts` files, which the page says RDT and react-docgen cannot.\n\n**Output formats (CLI only, except canonical JSON)**\n- RDT shape (ComponentDoc), Storybook `__docgenInfo`, TOON, and JSON Schema.\n\n**Component and styling support**\n- Class components: partial, props only.\n- Generics: partial, not through nested alias chains.\n- styled-components and Emotion: not detected.\n- class-variance-authority, Tailwind Variants, and Panda CSS: supported (Tailwind Variants and Panda slots partial).\n\n**Distribution and status**\n- Not on npm or crates.io, and no prebuilt binaries yet. Build from source.\n- Binary and packages still use the working name `oxc-react-docgen`.\n- License: AGPL-3.0-or-later.\n- Watch mode: adding, deleting, or renaming files requires a fresh session."}]},"uuid":"09aa8a86-0431-4eb3-b329-e18c8f539ec0","timestamp":"2026-10-25T18:30:47.649Z","toolUseResult":{"bytes":11155,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"## Quantitative and comparative claims\n\n**Speed (Caliper vs. RDT and react-docgen)**\n- Cold run, shared Node harness: Caliper 2.96 s, react-docgen 3.39 s, RDT 10.37 s. Apple Silicon Mac, 21 component libraries, 10 runs, July 2026.\n- Caliper binary alone, whole corpus: 50.5 ms cold run, 48 runs, same machine and month.\n- Single-file update: about 2 ms. The page also gives 1.74 to 2.13 ms across three fixtures.\n- The page says the Node harness time is mostly Node startup that all three tools pay.\n- Problem statement: \"On a design system that takes seconds, and every edit pays it again.\"\n- Comparison table lists RDT and react-docgen as having \"No incremental API.\"\n\n**Accuracy and coverage**\n- On 33 test components, Caliper misses 2,720 of RDT's props. 2,696 come from 10 components that need a type checker, and 24 are `ref` and `key`.\n- antd's Button: 312 props in Caliper vs. 313 in RDT.\n- Prototype TS 7.1 backend: same props as RDT on 13 components, with none missing or extra, including the 10 above.\n- Template literal types expand up to 4,096 values before becoming opaque.\n\n**Versions and dates**\n- Benchmarks used RDT 2.2.2 and react-docgen 7.1.1. They have not been re-run since July 2026.\n- Build requires Rust 1.94 or later.\n- TS 7.1 beta is expected 2026-10-06; stable is expected 2026-11-24. The page says these are TypeScript's dates.\n\n**Other numeric or behavioral details**\n- `check` exits 2 on errors and 1 on warnings with `--strict`.\n- `.d.ts` caching is keyed by content in `node_modules/.cache`.\n- `@types/react` is parsed once per run.\n\n## Feature claims\n\n**Integrations**\n- Storybook: output only (`__docgenInfo`), with no addon or preset.\n- Language server: starts but answers no hover requests. Prop hovers are planned.\n- Vite plugin: HMR updates, works in `vite build` and `--watch`.\n- Node binding: incremental sessions, returns canonical JSON only.\n- Rust plugin hooks: built, Rust only.\n\n**TypeScript and type-checker support**\n- The TS 7.1 backend is opt-in and planned. The TypeScript client is built but not connected.\n- No type checker is used. Conditional types, `infer`, and mapped types over generics come out opaque.\n- Caliper reads `.d.ts` files, which the page says RDT and react-docgen cannot.\n\n**Output formats (CLI only, except canonical JSON)**\n- RDT shape (ComponentDoc), Storybook `__docgenInfo`, TOON, and JSON Schema.\n\n**Component and styling support**\n- Class components: partial, props only.\n- Generics: partial, not through nested alias chains.\n- styled-components and Emotion: not detected.\n- class-variance-authority, Tailwind Variants, and Panda CSS: supported (Tailwind Variants and Panda slots partial).\n\n**Distribution and status**\n- Not on npm or crates.io, and no prebuilt binaries yet. Build from source.\n- Binary and packages still use the working name `oxc-react-docgen`.\n- License: AGPL-3.0-or-later.\n- Watch mode: adding, deleting, or renaming files requires a fresh session.","durationMs":10484,"url":"https://orin-dx.com/tools/caliper/"},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"54b5a521-b589-4de3-a6bb-40b5fd9c0beb","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","root":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","branch":"chore/reset-equivalence-allow-list","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/caliper","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/caliper","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/caliper","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"8132fef7-9a9a-400f-b08b-21a766f708d4","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"session_id":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","version":"2.1.308","gitBranch":"perf/shared-index-on-growth","slug":"purring-snuggling-matsumoto"}
