{"parentUuid":"a51a463b-a2a1-4a35-a752-4e7eec7d8c28","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgPS11KSPb9k541VqCgzb","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1452,"cache_read_input_tokens":657221,"output_tokens":2501,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1140},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1452,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2501,"cache_read_input_tokens":657221,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1452,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1452},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":14150,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"9fb086d2-d225-4637-9964-608cd80ec67e","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgPRzzrR3GLxWo25BYKV7","requestRef":"43c791a1-6171-4854-bf22-29f65a78c952","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"d9827307-9a75-48d2-add3-bc01e2b79d78","timestamp":"2026-10-25T18:31:10.424Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","version":"2.1.308","gitBranch":"perf/shared-index-on-growth","slug":"purring-snuggling-matsumoto"}
{"parentUuid":"d9827307-9a75-48d2-add3-bc01e2b79d78","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgPS11KSPb9k541VqCgzb","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"That page is stale on about a dozen claims, and a few of them undersell what exists now. It's dated July 2026, and its own text says the benchmarks \"have not been re-run since July 2026\". I haven't changed anything on the site or in the repo.\n\n**Wrong or outdated now**\n\n| Page says | Now |\n| --- | --- |\n| Storybook: output only, no addon or preset | There is an addon (`caliper-docgen-storybook`) with a docgen provider and a Vite plugin. It runs a lazy per-component session, routes degraded components to Storybook's docgen, logs why, and checks freshness per story. This is the biggest gap. |\n| TS 7.1 backend \"planned\", client \"built but not connected\" | Shipped in #154 as an experimental opt-in (`--experimental-semantic-types`). It is not the default, and it is slower (0.5–9.3 s on the large corpora). |\n| Language server \"starts but answers no hover\" | Removed in #196, which is open and unmerged. Prop hovers are no longer planned. |\n| Not on npm or crates.io, no prebuilt binaries, working name `oxc-react-docgen` | Renamed to caliper. Releases exist on `main` (0.5.x, with a release PR #160 pending). I haven't verified whether the packages are published. |\n| No type checker, conditional types and mapped types come out opaque | Conditional, indexed-access and mapped types with known operands are evaluated, and `--load-dependencies` reads types from installed packages. Opaque remains for inference (`infer`, unbound generics), and `z.infer`-style types still need the checker. |\n| Misses 2,720 of RDT's props on 33 components, 2,696 from 10 that need a type checker | Probably much smaller now, since dependency loading and the Ark/Radix/intersection fixes resolved many of those. I haven't re-measured. |\n| Watch mode: add/delete/rename needs a fresh session | May have changed with the watch-lifecycle work. I haven't checked. |\n| Rust 1.94 or later | CI now builds with 1.98.1. The MSRV job exists, so the minimum may differ. |\n| Benchmarks: RDT 2.2.2 and react-docgen 7.1.1, July 2026 | Not re-run. |\n\n**Speed claims that need care when refreshed**\n- The page's headline compares a shared Node harness: Caliper 2.96 s, react-docgen 3.39 s, RDT 10.37 s on 21 libraries. That is about 3.5× against RDT, because Node startup dominates all three.\n- The 19–89× I quoted earlier was caliper's CLI against RDT, a different methodology. Any new claim should say which one it is, or readers will see two inconsistent multiples.\n- \"Single-file update about 2 ms\" has not been re-measured since the lazy session, schema change and cache work.\n- The \"50.5 ms cold run for the whole corpus\" binary figure is also from July. Cold runs I've measured since: 55–110 ms without dependencies, 90–340 ms with them.\n\n**Things the page doesn't mention that we now have**\n- The lazy session API for Rust (first story in 55–150 ms) and a versioned canonical JSON.\n- A fallback rate of 0–10% against Storybook's docgen, down from 38–92%.\n- The TS 7.1 oracle and the equivalence check as quality gates.\n\n**What I'd do**\n1. Run the clean comparison I parked, using the page's own methodology (21 libraries, shared Node harness, 10 runs) so the numbers are comparable, plus the CLI-level figures, labelled as such.\n2. Draft replacement copy from the measured numbers. The site isn't in this repo, so you'd paste it, or point me at the site repo.\n3. Meanwhile, fix the plainly false lines (Storybook addon, TS 7.1 status, LSP, name and distribution status) now, since they don't depend on measuring.\n\nWhich do you want first? The parked comparison would also need the quiet machine, so I'd wait until `cheap-context` and `antd-gaps` finish."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1452,"cache_read_input_tokens":657221,"output_tokens":2501,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1140},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1452,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2501,"cache_read_input_tokens":657221,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1452,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1452},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"9fb086d2-d225-4637-9964-608cd80ec67e","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgPRzzrR3GLxWo25BYKV7","requestRef":"43c791a1-6171-4854-bf22-29f65a78c952","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"c3b64448-1d04-460f-b9b7-f9729b5d2551","timestamp":"2026-10-25T18:31:14.573Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","version":"2.1.308","gitBranch":"perf/shared-index-on-growth","slug":"purring-snuggling-matsumoto"}
