{"parentUuid":"be12f247-69f3-4f34-b969-cdbdec6f3b2f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgPSDYJLs8tr4GRNXDLr1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":952,"cache_read_input_tokens":669482,"output_tokens":2171,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":938},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":952,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2171,"cache_read_input_tokens":669482,"cache_creation_input_tokens":952,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":952},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.2.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"}],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":12989,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"3d0d46a2-eb6c-43ab-81f1-0f98558a5601","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgPSDXpKgpEmzJFAAWdvN","requestRef":"7fd3ea3f-cf0c-4caa-9f2b-4a1546d25261","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"c502c214-58df-4fca-bbac-47057397ced2","timestamp":"2026-10-25T18:33:52.167Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","version":"2.1.308","gitBranch":"perf/shared-index-on-growth","slug":"purring-snuggling-matsumoto"}
{"parentUuid":"c502c214-58df-4fca-bbac-47057397ced2","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgPSDYJLs8tr4GRNXDLr1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"These are the recorded 0.4.0 parity baseline (RDT 2.x in-process, 7 runs, installed dependencies) plus my adjustments for the speed work since. They are estimates, not a fresh run.\n\n**Speed against RDT (×faster, deps off → on)**\n\n| Library | Baseline | My estimate now |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Mantine | 25× → 24× | ~27× |\n| Chakra | 488× → 45× | 500× → ~100× |\n| shadcn | 53× → 35× | ~58× → ~38× |\n| antd | 32× → 28× | ~35× → ~31× |\n| Spectrum | 19× → 17× | ~21× → ~19× |\n\n- **Overall:** about 20–60× in the common case; Chakra with dependencies is the outlier, because it went from 550 ms to about 240 ms while RDT takes about 25 s.\n- **Percent:** caliper's own time is down about 10% on most corpora and about 55% on Chakra with dependencies since the baseline, so the ratios rise by the same factors.\n- **Off** reports only a sliver of Chakra's props (0.1%), so its 488× compares unlike work. Use the \"on\" column.\n\n**Memory against RDT (×less, deps off → on)**\n\n| Library | Baseline | My estimate now |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Mantine | 4.3× → 4.2× | ~4.3× |\n| Chakra | 19× → 1.1× | ~19× → ~4.5× (1,461 MiB → ~345 MiB) |\n| shadcn | 11× → 6.3× | ~11× → ~6.5× |\n| antd | 9× → 8× | ~9× → ~8× |\n| Spectrum | 4.3× → 3.8× | ~4.5× → ~4× |\n\n- **Overall:** about 4–9× less. Chakra with dependencies went from barely better to about 4.5× less.\n- **Lazy sessions** hold far less than batch, but I can't turn that into an RDT ratio without a run.\n\n**Quality: share of RDT's props we report (structural, deps on) and what the TS 7.1 opt-in adds**\n\n| Library | Missing, structural | Missing, with TS 7.1 opt-in |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Mantine | ~0.3% | ~0% |\n| Chakra | ~1.4% | ~0% |\n| shadcn | ~60% (39.5% reported at baseline; I'd guess ~45–55% reported now) | ~4% (96% found) |\n| antd | ~20% (80.3% reported) | ~3% (97% found) |\n| Spectrum | ~0.3% | ~0% |\n\n- **Control match:** same Storybook control as RDT is 93–100% structural on four corpora, 87% on shadcn. With TS 7.1 it is 88–100%.\n- **The TS 7.1 trade-off.** It closes shadcn's and antd's missing props, but exact type text drops (Mantine 19.5%, Chakra 1.0%, Spectrum 65.4%) because TypeScript prints types differently, not because they're wrong. It costs time and memory: 0.5–9.3 s, Chakra 975 MiB. Those figures predate the structural improvements.\n\n**react-docgen:** I have no per-library numbers. The site's one data point is a shared Node harness: caliper 2.96 s, react-docgen 3.39 s, RDT 10.37 s. That is only 1.15× faster than react-docgen, because Node startup dominates all three.\n\nTreat shadcn's recall as the least certain figure. The numbers are mine, adjusted for later fixes, and a clean run would replace them."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":952,"cache_read_input_tokens":669482,"output_tokens":2171,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":938},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":952,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2171,"cache_read_input_tokens":669482,"cache_creation_input_tokens":952,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":952},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.2.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"}],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"3d0d46a2-eb6c-43ab-81f1-0f98558a5601","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgPSDXpKgpEmzJFAAWdvN","requestRef":"7fd3ea3f-cf0c-4caa-9f2b-4a1546d25261","requeste