{"type":"api-request","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","id":"37695da9-0d86-466a-8786-f4dd341635cf","timestamp":"2026-10-25T18:40:48.759Z","version":"2.1.308","querySource":"repl_main_thread:outputStyle:Concise","shapeHash":"695ec5a8802936862d1cd8c71e730e293e4e9e400bcbffb95f0146470866b732","params":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","betas":["claude-code-20250219","oauth-2025-04-20","interleaved-thinking-2025-05-14","thinking-token-count-2026-05-13","context-management-2025-06-27","prompt-caching-scope-2026-01-05","per-turn-control-2026-07-01","mid-conversation-tool-changes-2026-07-01","inline-tools-2026-09-15","advisor-tool-2026-03-01","advanced-tool-use-2025-11-20","mid-conversation-system-clear-at-2026-08-21","effort-2025-11-24","dangerous-tool-use-2026-09-03","thinking-binding-controls-2026-08-01","thinking-display-updates-2026-08-18","afk-mode-2026-01-31","extended-cache-ttl-2025-04-11","cache-diagnosis-2026-04-07","message-threads-2026-08-12"],"max_tokens":128000,"thinking":{"type":"adaptive","display":"updates"},"context_management":{"edits":[{"type":"clear_thinking_20251015","keep":"all"}]},"output_config":{"effort":"medium"}},"base":"5e8e8a70-b5a1-4e51-a7c1-d22145c998cb","keep":843,"tail":["c25dd293c20dd7ea0bfbefaae24d05a4fc02cc569ac5414070d4188fb1c710a5","452e8b1418d47eff1e253f4326f2b2e9b8ec9d3ee63bb13b37e9cb63ea9d38f2","f6530651d9f5fbc8dc85e098a484da08ed99236a9abfa0db9e5ddc2f9ca90248"],"cacheControl":[{"path":["system",1],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h","scope":"global"}},{"path":["system",2],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}},{"path":["messages",845,"content",0],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}}],"requestDigest":"edf623a74d6698f22a19b981aaedced89fd16aa345e0ce9800920efcef1f2c8b"}
{"parentUuid":"f4f886b5-b9c5-41a9-88da-caefc5ff3e87","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgPSmJsMZ6PyZ7H4Mk7sj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Partly. Where RDT is behind us, it's real but concentrated in two places, so \"many\" overstates it.\n\n**What the recorded data shows** (deps on, baseline 0.4.0, props both tools report)\n\n| Library | Shared props | RDT lists an enum as `string`, we list the enum | RDT says `any`/`unknown`, we are concrete |\n| --- | --: | --: | --: |\n| Mantine | 19,595 | 0 | 7 |\n| Chakra | 470,009 | 0 | 2 |\n| shadcn | 5,134 | **249** | **79** |\n| antd | 2,395 | 0 | 2 |\n| Spectrum | 16,324 | 0 | **90** |\n\n- **Enums:** the gain is real but only visible on shadcn (249 props, about 5% of the shared set). On the other four corpora RDT never degraded an enum to `string`. So \"better enums than RDT in many places\" holds for shadcn-style libraries, not generally.\n- **Concrete where RDT gives up:** 380 props in total across the five. Spectrum's 90 and shadcn's 79 stand out, and the rest are a handful.\n- **Everywhere else** the two agree on the enum or union, or we are the one behind. The reverse losses (what we lose against RDT) are far bigger in count: for example Mantine has 6,542 indexed-access reads left as `X[\"k\"]`, 469 template literals left, 355 rest parameters lost.\n\n**On exact text:** agreed, it's the wrong metric, and I'd stop quoting it. The right measures are correct types and the same control, which is what the loss categories above track.\n\n**An honest caveat on \"getting types right.\"** Both tools are compared with each other here, not with the truth. The ground truth is the TS 7.1 oracle: caliper contradicts it on 0.0–0.3% of props, and the oracle comparison for RDT itself has not been run on these corpora. To say \"more correct than RDT\", we'd need that run. I'd add it to the parked clean comparison.\n\nThe shadcn and Spectrum rows are where the story is strongest, so those are the examples I'd use if you publish this."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1064,"cache_read_input_tokens":677075,"output_tokens":708,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1064,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":708,"cache_read_input_tokens":677075,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1064,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1064},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"05f31b1e-bc4c-44cd-a76b-6d2490dbc093","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgPSmJTne3rvQTRD8xe3t","requestRef":"37695da9-0d86-466a-8786-f4dd341635cf","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"73389df1-12e6-47c8-a30d-b456851f21a7","timestamp":"2026-10-25T18:40:55.907Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","version":"2.1.308","gitBranch":"perf/shared-index-on-growth","slug":"purring-snuggling-matsumoto"}
