{"parentUuid":"4fe488b3-1aeb-41e1-ba17-a8ba579af7bf","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgPSnUzb1txpWqQkokcfz","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":798,"cache_read_input_tokens":678139,"output_tokens":1189,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":473},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":798,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1189,"cache_read_input_tokens":678139,"cache_creation_input_tokens":798,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":798},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":3290,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"bc5ec164-625d-42be-a885-f918f1b26412","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgPSnUcmZRhctfbA4WDQS","requestRef":"0a8d0ddb-7b87-4cd3-885a-3e20af904d4a","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"86fcca64-38fb-450f-b82f-85df7c4352db","timestamp":"2026-10-25T18:41:09.425Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","version":"2.1.308","gitBranch":"perf/shared-index-on-growth","slug":"purring-snuggling-matsumoto"}
{"parentUuid":"86fcca64-38fb-450f-b82f-85df7c4352db","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgPSnUzb1txpWqQkokcfz","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes, with one distinction: there are two different opt-ins, and the speed work pays off in one of them and not the other.\n\n**`--load-dependencies` (reads installed packages' types).** Every \"deps on\" figure I gave is in this mode, and this is where the speed work landed.\n- Chakra with dependencies went from 550 ms and 1,461 MiB at the 0.4.0 baseline to about 240 ms and about 345 MB now.\n- Spectrum, shadcn, antd and Mantine gained about 10% in time.\n- Memory is lower on Chakra and Spectrum and flat elsewhere (shadcn's lazy session is the exception until `cheap-context` lands).\n\n**`--experimental-semantic-types` (the TS 7.1 backend).** The speed work does not carry over to this one.\n- Its cost is the `tsc` process checking the program, 0.5–9.3 s and up to 975 MiB on Chakra, which the resolver changes don't touch.\n- The way it gets faster is the design I proposed: use it only for the few components the structural path flags as degraded, on a warm checker, instead of for the whole project.\n- Its accuracy gains (shadcn 40% → 96%, antd 80% → 97% of props found) were measured before the structural fixes, so they shrink as the structural path improves.\n\n**A useful consequence: the default can probably change.** STATUS.md says `--load-dependencies` \"becomes the default in 0.5.0 once that cost is fixed\", and the blocker was Chakra at 1.3 GB and 0.5 s. That cost is now about 345 MB and 240 ms. The addon already defaults it on. The CLI and config still default it off, under ADR 0010.\n\nFlipping the CLI default would need a new ADR (reversing one needs one) and a minor changeset. Dependencies on is the mode where caliper's accuracy case is strongest: Chakra goes from 0.1% to 98.6% of RDT's props.\n\nI can start a fork to write that ADR and flip the default, with a measured before and after across the five corpora. It would hold until `cheap-context` lands, since that changes shadcn's memory in this mode. Want it queued?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":798,"cache_read_input_tokens":678139,"output_tokens":1189,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":473},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":798,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1189,"cache_read_input_tokens":678139,"cache_creation_input_tokens":798,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":798},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"bc5ec164-625d-42be-a885-f918f1b26412","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgPSnUcmZRhctfbA4WDQS","requestRef":"0a8d0ddb-7b87-4cd3-885a-3e20af904d4a","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"35acf3f9-19b1-44ee-a35c-180f0de3c1c3","timestamp":"2026-10-25T18:41:14.563Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","version":"2.1.308","gitBranch":"perf/shared-index-on-growth","slug":"purring-snuggling-matsumoto"}
