{"type":"bridge-session","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","bridgeSessionId":"cse_01D7CJmXuD2ASqfBYm7Lk4WZ","lastSequenceNum":21749,"ownerAccountUuid":"138d593e-e185-4f72-89f2-82e1a501f134","ownerOrganizationUuid":"602db9b4-428d-49e6-a99c-64152cc62a79"}
{"parentUuid":"f125ed2b-b3fb-4fb5-8fc5-64ab0d81ee7c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgPSyPF7xYUTNcc7a8xC3","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The `deps-default` fork is running with a cap of about 70 tool calls. It branches off `main` and opens its PR against `main`.\n\n**What it does**\n1. **ADR 0019**, superseding 0010's \"off by default\" clause. Dependency loading is on by default, with `--no-load-dependencies` and `loadDependencies: false` to turn it off. It updates the ADR index.\n2. **Flips the default everywhere it is set:** the pipeline default, the CLI (`--load-dependencies` stays accepted as a no-op alias), the config schema, NAPI and its type declarations, the Vite plugin, the README files, `docs/STATUS.md`, the architecture docs and the scripts. Recorded baselines must still compare like for like.\n3. **Measures default-mode runs** on the five corpora against the old default, and against RDT's props:\n   - Wall time, peak memory, props reported and unresolved warnings.\n   - A project without `node_modules` installed, to confirm it degrades gracefully with the same `UNRESOLVABLE_IMPORT` warnings and negligible time cost.\n   - A workspace-style monorepo sanity check.\n4. **Gates:** the new default must be byte-identical to the old build run with explicit `--load-dependencies` (differences from the old default are expected, but I told it not to allow-list them wholesale). Lazy parity, lint, tests and CI green. Minor changeset, since default behaviour changes.\n\n**Timing caveat:** `cheap-context` and `antd-gaps` are still running, so its timings carry some noise. It interleaves and repeats runs, and reports the noise.\n\nFor on-demand TS 7.1, I'd scope it as a design fork next (ADR plus the degraded-components fallback). It needs TS 7.1 stable, which the site lists for 2026-11-24, before it could become a default. Say if you want that started in parallel.\n\nRunning now: `cheap-context`, `antd-gaps`, `deps-default`. Open PRs: #196, #197, #198, #199 and #160."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6473,"cache_read_input_tokens":680247,"output_tokens":675,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6473,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":675,"cache_read_input_tokens":680247,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6473,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6473},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"d2223f33-c324-425b-aca9-f34f7919fafd","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgPSyNsnUCHqKPRUnua1V","requestRef":"41f0bd3e-5283-4b45-8f95-cb4bcfdf61ef","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"ab81138e-12ea-43b5-bd16-7c70fcf673d1","timestamp":"2026-10-25T18:43:38.595Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","version":"2.1.308","gitBranch":"perf/shared-index-on-growth","slug":"purring-snuggling-matsumoto"}
