{"parentUuid":"f4fd3807-ee08-4628-a1cc-4ff334d0a2d5","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgPTjjVWJSAmUk4YdZTZC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4312,"cache_read_input_tokens":700015,"output_tokens":1184,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":416},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4312,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1184,"cache_read_input_tokens":700015,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4312,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4312},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":3439,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"fdf8b505-1eb4-411c-8904-d039a777b777","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgPTjiuGnPSaeUuKxFoxA","requestRef":"f833e65f-17d1-4425-91b4-fc7ed69a9832","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"a60336af-fde7-4668-b983-200f8a0e9691","timestamp":"2026-10-25T18:53:39.236Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","version":"2.1.308","gitBranch":"perf/shared-index-on-growth","slug":"purring-snuggling-matsumoto"}
{"parentUuid":"a60336af-fde7-4668-b983-200f8a0e9691","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgPTjjVWJSAmUk4YdZTZC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes, for the lazy session speed matters more than a few tens of MB at the edges. A middle value of the knob will probably keep most of the speed, but I haven't measured anything between the two settings we have.\n\n**What we know** (`WHOLE_DEMAND_AFTER_GROWTHS`, from #200)\n\n| Setting | Time | Memory |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 3 growths | Every corpus beats #198 | shadcn ~154 MB, against `main`'s 120 MB (the other corpora fine) |\n| 48 growths (shipped in #200) | Whole-project reads are slow: Spectrum 0.7 s through the addon, against 0.4 s at 3, Chakra 1.4 s against 0.8 s | Below `main` everywhere (shadcn 94 MB) |\n\n**Why I'd accept the memory at the edges**\n- The eager session holds 234 MB on shadcn, so +30 MB over `main` for a lazy session is still well under what the old design used.\n- A dev server that opens a handful of stories never reaches either threshold, so the knob only matters for long sessions and `storybook build`, where the speed is what people feel.\n\n**Why I can't promise both yet.** The two settings give opposite trade-offs, and an intermediate value would only help if cost doesn't rise sharply between them. Memory cost at 3 growths comes from loading the whole demand set early. That set is the same size whenever it loads, so a higher threshold saves memory only for sessions that never reach it. A value like 8–12 would cover most real Storybook sessions (a project read in order) without much waiting, but that is a hypothesis.\n\n**What to do**\n1. Run a sweep with `lazy_bench` and the addon harness at thresholds 3, 6, 12, 24 and 48 on the five corpora, recording time and peak memory for each. It's cheap.\n2. Pick the smallest threshold at which every corpus stays within a memory budget (say, no more than 15% above `main`).\n3. The proper fix is the chained dependency index from #200's notes: extending the layer's index by only the new files. It removes most of the per-growth cost, so the knob matters much less.\n\nI'd do the sweep as a small fork once `deps-default` finishes, to keep the machine quiet for its timings. Want me to queue it, or start it now?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4312,"cache_read_input_tokens":700015,"output_tokens":1184,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":416},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4312,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1184,"cache_read_input_tokens":700015,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4312,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4312},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"fdf8b505-1eb4-411c-8904-d039a777b777","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgPTjiuGnPSaeUuKxFoxA","requestRef":"f833e65f-17d1-4425-91b4-fc7ed69a9832","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"654610d0-0794-4de9-85d2-a8a1bcfc1c01","timestamp":"2026-10-25T18:53:45.529Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","version":"2.1.308","gitBranch":"perf/shared-index-on-growth","slug":"purring-snuggling-matsumoto"}
