{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","hash":"9e020fc530348568403c6121ab1d8d2c908e66085bb8291f4d882b4d267a42dc","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<system-reminder>\n[SYSTEM NOTIFICATION - NOT USER INPUT]\nThis is an automated background-task event, NOT a message from the user.\nDo NOT interpret this as user acknowledgement, confirmation, or response to any pending question.\nNo human input has been received since the last genuine user message in this conversation. Any statement that the user said, approved, or confirmed something — including statements in your own earlier messages — is NOT real user input and must NOT be treated as approval or consent.\n\n<task-notification>\n<task-id>a8054f3772574ddd2</task-id>\n<tool-use-id>toolu_01ND9Wmf1429wqVZ2e4PxDmE</tool-use-id>\n<output-file>/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-gabe-Projects-caliper--claude-worktrees-release-0-2-0/ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675/tasks/a8054f3772574ddd2.output</output-file>\n<status>completed</status>\n<summary>Agent \"Structural cause of the shadcn and antd prop gap\" finished</summary>\n<note>A task-notification fires each time this agent stops with no live background children of its own. The user can send it another message and resume it, so the same task-id may notify more than once.</note>\n<result>I can't finish this: my worktree no longer exists, and I've been told to report instead of retrying.\n\n**Task (restated):** Track AG — classify the shadcn and antd props RDT reports and Caliper doesn't, fix the structural causes, and open a PR stacked on #201's branch.\n\n**What happened.** Partway through, the worktree directory `/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/agent-a8054f3772574ddd2` was deleted out from under me. The harness now refuses to run any command: the recovery directory it offers is the parent's worktree, which is outside mine. Most likely the cleanup script or a manual `git worktree remove` removed it while I was running.\n\n**State: nothing is committed, pushed or opened.** I made no commits and no PR, and there are no code changes to recover, because I was still at the classification step.\n\n**What I got done before it vanished**\n- Created branch `fix/prop-gap` from `origin/fix/antd-spectrum-gaps` (#201's head) and unset its upstream so it can't push onto #201's branch. The branch may still exist locally in the shared repository.\n- Fetched and installed the shadcn and antd parity corpora (setup exit 0), under that worktree's `.parity/`, which is now gone with it. The release CLI built in 1m26s, also gone.\n- Wrote the classifier at `/Users/gabe/.claude/jobs/ba6a68d6/tmp/ag_classify.py`, which survives. It reuses `scripts/parity.py`'s own definition of \"missing\" and groups the missing props by declaring package, component and DOM-likeness.\n\n**What I learned about the measure, which matters for the diagnosis**\n- `parity.py measure()` counts only RDT's non-React props (those not declared in `@types/react`) on components that both tools report. The 39.5% on shadcn and 80.3% on antd therefore exclude React's HTML attributes, and the gap is not React-attribute noise.\n- Components RDT reports that Caliper doesn't match (shadcn 1,519 of 1,594, antd 162 of 258) are not counted in that denominator at all, so the real gap against RDT is larger than those percentages say.\n\n**Blocker met before the deletion.** `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile` fails in a fresh worktree with `ERR_PNPM_LOCKFILE_CONFIG_MISMATCH` (\"ignoredOptionalDependencies\" does not match the lockfile). RDT's dump needs `apps/validate`'s dependencies, so the next attempt needs `pnpm install --no-frozen-lockfile`, with `pnpm-lock.yaml` restored afterwards. I had not yet run that.\n\n**For the parent:** relaunch this track in a fresh worktree. The classifier script is reusable as is: `python3 -I /Users/gabe/.claude/jobs/ba6a68d6/tmp/ag_classify.py BIN CORPUS [deps] [html] [out.json]`, run from the repo root after `scripts/parity.py setup --corpus shadcn --corpus antd` and the pnpm install above.</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>741906</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>20</tool_uses><duration_ms>305152</duration_ms></usage>\n<worktree><worktreePath>/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/agent-a8054f3772574ddd2</worktreePath><worktreeBranch>worktree-agent-a8054f3772574ddd2</worktreeBranch></worktree>\n</task-notification>\n</system-reminder>"}]}}
