{"type":"bridge-session","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","bridgeSessionId":"cse_01D7CJmXuD2ASqfBYm7Lk4WZ","lastSequenceNum":21749,"ownerAccountUuid":"138d593e-e185-4f72-89f2-82e1a501f134","ownerOrganizationUuid":"602db9b4-428d-49e6-a99c-64152cc62a79"}
{"parentUuid":"bf76057c-ddf2-4416-9e6f-2e3eef6a75c1","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"bc5176d7-6e57-4f44-a79c-14dc9371404a","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","content":"Exit code 1\n## Summary\n- Keep each dependency growth in a bounded chain and flatten after eight links.\n- Load the remaining project names after three growths.\n- Index a file when it is first claimed as a declaration, even if an earlier layer parsed it as a re-export stub.\n\n## Verification\n- Core library tests: 639 passed; clippy and formatting passed.\n- Lazy parity passed on five installed corpora in batch, forward, and reverse request order.\n- All ten benchmark output digests matched the prior build. The three-growth chain improved whole-project time on all five corpora; shadcn's 50-request peak rose from 94 to 144 MB compared with a 48-growth threshold.\n\n## Limitation\nThe local full snapshot run had seven absolute-path-prefix differences because this worktree resolves node_modules through the main checkout.\n\n(eval):1: ===== not found","is_error":true,"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DPuvLMKiZja7CJKcqbwwmQ"}]},"uuid":"f9339ee0-86ce-41c8-893c-27103fec8650","timestamp":"2026-10-26T13:28:22.833Z","toolUseResult":"Error: Exit code 1\n## Summary\n- Keep each dependency growth in a bounded chain and flatten after eight links.\n- Load the remaining project names after three growths.\n- Index a file when it is first claimed as a declaration, even if an earlier layer parsed it as a re-export stub.\n\n## Verification\n- Core library tests: 639 passed; clippy and formatting passed.\n- Lazy parity passed on five installed corpora in batch, forward, and reverse request order.\n- All ten benchmark output digests matched the prior build. The three-growth chain improved whole-project time on all five corpora; shadcn's 50-request peak rose from 94 to 144 MB compared with a 48-growth threshold.\n\n## Limitation\nThe local full snapshot run had seven absolute-path-prefix differ