{"parentUuid":"f4229645-1dbe-4329-ac1f-7189527327f7","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgR35GCagshETZRrSbnFx","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I removed all 21 of Codex's merged worktrees and deleted their 21 local branches.\n\n- **Worktrees:** all 21 came out without forcing. None was refused, so none had uncommitted changes.\n- **Branches:** each was a merged PR's head, or had its tip already in `main`. `-D` was needed because squash merges make `-d` refuse.\n- **Left alone on purpose:**\n  - `/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper-homebrew-tap` (`chore/homebrew-tap-notify`) and the two `oxc-*` worktrees, which aren't part of this work.\n  - `agent-a482304b1a114609f`, the old unattributed resolver patch (backed up).\n  - This session's worktree, detached at `origin/main`.\n\nStale remote branches may remain. I didn't check, and I can't delete remote branches from here. The next fetch with `--prune` will show what GitHub already deleted on merge.\n\nThe work I'd do next is unchanged: empty the equivalence allow-list again and make a non-empty list on `main` fail CI, make the speed gate run on resolver PRs and bisect the Mantine and Chakra regression, and fix the Parity install so Mantine and Spectrum are measured again. Want me to start with the allow-list and speed-gate PR?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1479,"cache_read_input_tokens":785429,"output_tokens":430,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1479,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":430,"cache_read_input_tokens":785429,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1479,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_toke