che, `--no-load-dependencies` AND default), report a table commit -> time; the machine may be shared with other forks: interleave and repeat. Classify: if the jump is #202's default flip, the scorecard's meaning is 'no dependencies installed', so pin the scorecard to explicit `--no-load-dependencies` (record dependency-loading cost separately as its own row/gate with a fair threshold) instead of calling it a regression; if it is resolver work, profile (macOS `sample`) the culprit PR's hot path and fix or narrow it (e.g. a lookup per component that should be memoized or a scan of all files per type) with byte-identical output (`just equivalence`, lazy_parity). Report which PR(s) cost how many ms on each corpus. Gates: scorecard `--check` passes locally for mantine and chakra vs a build of the pre-regression commit (`python3 scripts/scorecard.py --bin NEW --base-bin OLD --rdt --check`), `just lint doc-check machete typos` and `cargo nextest run --workspace --exclude caliper-docgen-napi --locked` exit codes read directly (never pipe through tail), CI green, changeset if shipped behavior changes. Time-box ~90 tool calls. Commits end with Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/REDACTED; PR bodies end with https://claude.ai/code/REDACTED; never push main/force-push/merge; /usr/bin/git with sandbox off, one plain git command per call."}},"serverClassifierRequest":"114f1a40-35b6-4807-9161-3488d8c115ad","apiBlockIndex":3,"requestId":"req_011CgR361JQueEUZAjD48PgB","requestRef":"9c47e437-51b4-439a-9c89-dea0f04e6e2a","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"d5b0b8ca-53b0-44ff-b312-aba99370af93","timestamp":"2026-10-26T14:52:09.105Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","version":"2.1.308",