{"type":"bridge-session","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","bridgeSessionId":"cse_01D7CJmXuD2ASqfBYm7Lk4WZ","lastSequenceNum":21749,"ownerAccountUuid":"138d593e-e185-4f72-89f2-82e1a501f134","ownerOrganizationUuid":"602db9b4-428d-49e6-a99c-64152cc62a79"}
{"parentUuid":"91299d66-d514-465f-8bc3-4938545e24fe","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgR3XBRpMqoLNxAC53Kuy","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The `ts-on-demand` fork is running with a cap of about 110 tool calls. It asks the checker only for the component a story requests, with no prediction, because #208 showed prediction doesn't work. It works in three steps.\n\n1. **Measure** (a spike), using the existing `semantic` and `tsc-client` crates on shadcn, antd, Mantine, Chakra and Spectrum:\n   - Checker startup cost, and warm per-component query latency (p50, p90, max over 50 random components).\n   - Memory of the warm `tsc` process.\n   - Accuracy gained per component, compared with the structural answer.\n   - Whether a query can be answered without re-checking the whole program, which is the point of a warm checker.\n   - Go or no-go against the addon's budget of about 150 ms for the first story and 5–20 ms after. If it's no-go, the fork reports the numbers and the design alternative and stops.\n2. **Design**, as an ADR:\n   - The lazy session owns a warm `tsc`, started lazily in the background.\n   - A request either waits up to N ms and falls back to structural with an Info diagnostic (`SEMANTIC_PENDING`), or answers structurally first and refines for the next request. The numbers decide which.\n   - Results are cached by file hash, config hash and `tsc` version in the persistent cache, with provenance when `tsc` answered.\n   - TypeScript becomes an optional peer dependency with a version range and a startup self-check, replacing the exact `7.1.0-beta` pin.\n   - Failures (missing, crashing or mismatched `tsc`) degrade to structural with one warning, and never fail a story.\n3. **Smallest working slice:** a session option and NAPI option, an addon option `semanticTypes: 'off' | 'on-demand'` (default off, as the opt-in rule says), a fake-server test plus one real-`tsc` test, and an end-to-end run through the Storybook harness on shadcn and antd.\n\nWith mode off, results must be byte-identical to today's. Six forks are now running: `gates`, `scorecard-bisect`, `callee-shape`, `type-losses`, `unmatched-components` and `ts-on-demand`, so timing numbers will be noisy and each fork has been told to repeat and report noise."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6957,"cache_read_input_tokens":808725,"output_tokens":753,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6957,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":753,"cache_read_input_tokens":808725,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6957,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6957},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"88ebb88f-9ff0-4706-95e9-4ea2469d95ec","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgR3XB1GNmWUQTJ5P7sCf","requestRef":"c281cfd5-9505-4262-b5c9-0c099767998a","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"e5aef118-6361-4d80-9194-b9e5406a22bd","timestamp":"2026-10-26T14:57:17.826Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","version":"2.1.308","gitBranch":"ci/repair-gates","slug":"purring-snuggling-matsumoto"}
