{"parentUuid":"3e05c054-77af-4a06-a139-f13a1c28afc0","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgR4ToDs7qF86oFVyW53V","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The Scorecard regression was #202, not Codex's resolver work, and PR #226 is open with all 15 checks passing.\n\n**The bisect** (eight commits from #201 to `main`, best of 15, median ms)\n\n| Build | Mantine default | Mantine `--no-load-dependencies` | Chakra default | Chakra `--no-load-dependencies` |\n| --- | --: | --: | --: | --: |\n| #201 | 61.0 | 57.2 | 57.1 | 57.6 |\n| #214 | 61.0 | 58.0 | 57.7 | 58.4 |\n| **#202** | **71.4** | 58.4 | **66.6** | 57.7 |\n| `main` | 72.2 | 58.2 | 63.4 | 58.7 |\n\n- **Default mode jumps at #202 alone:** +10 ms on Mantine and +9 ms on Chakra.\n- **Resolver and extractor work is cheap:** #204–#220 cost 0–1 ms with dependencies off. That clears Codex's changes on speed.\n- **Why #202 costs time:** the scorecard corpora have no `node_modules`. The dependency index only stores answers found inside a package, so every run redoes each failed import's directory walk, about 10 ms.\n\n**The fix** (`scripts/scorecard.py`, `docs/performance.md`)\n- The scorecard runs with `--no-load-dependencies` when the build has the flag, so a base build with a different default still compares like for like.\n- A new \"With dependencies loading\" column times the default mode and has its own gate at 1.7× the loading-off time. Measured 1.16–1.21× here.\n- The check against `main` and the #214 build passes every gate at 0.91–0.98× of base. The same two builds fail the old gate at 1.17×. The RDT-ratio gate (`--rdt`) was not run; it is unchanged.\n- Lint exits 0. There are no Rust changes, so no changeset.\n\n**Not done.** Caching failed resolutions for a project with no `node_modules` would remove the 10 ms, but it touches the index format and PnP and `paths` resolution, so it was left. Real projects have `node_modules` and don't pay it.\n\n**Merge:** #226 is independent, with base `main`. It makes the failing Scorecard on `main` green again once merged. Together with the `gates` fork's PR trigger, the speed gate should stop this class of regression from landing ungated.\n\nStill running: `gates`, `callee-shape`, `type-losses`, `unmatched-components` and `ts-on-demand`. The timing-sensitive measurement of merged `main` (oracle, harness, RDT and react-docgen) can start once the machine is quiet, and `scorecard-bisect` is now done, so I'll queue it after the next fork finishes."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2033,"cache_read_input_tokens":824282,"output_tokens":930,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2033,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":930,"cache_read_input_tokens":824282,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2033,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2033},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.2.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"}],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"f52e778f-19b6-404c-97b9-99920de45a02","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgR4TnbRFbrJUQH43Z89G","requestRef":"7b3ff919-98b9-4991-bf61-5d908b527e88","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"577870b8-ce34-4527-8bcd-3ab933bda055","timestamp":"2026-10-26T15:09:39.490Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","sessi