{"type":"bridge-session","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","bridgeSessionId":"cse_01D7CJmXuD2ASqfBYm7Lk4WZ","lastSequenceNum":21749,"ownerAccountUuid":"138d593e-e185-4f72-89f2-82e1a501f134","ownerOrganizationUuid":"602db9b4-428d-49e6-a99c-64152cc62a79"}
{"parentUuid":"ae089d38-8e25-4dc0-97a3-a9916c4fbb61","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgR7SC9ntET6SnfyvCetK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes. It's `orin-dx/homebrew-tap`, described as \"Checksum-pinned Homebrew formulae for Orin DX tools\". It was last pushed 2026-10-26 at 06:46 UTC, a few minutes after the Codex batch merged.\n\n**What I can see**\n- **It's a shared tap for all Orin DX tools.** It has `Formula/`, `scripts/`, `tools/` and `docs/`, so it isn't caliper-specific.\n- **`/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper-homebrew-tap` is not the tap.** It is a worktree of this repo (remote `caliper.git`) on branch `chore/homebrew-tap-notify`, whose tip is already in `main`.\n- **This repo doesn't mention Homebrew.** `git grep -i homebrew` on `main` finds nothing, so no docs, README or workflow here reference the tap.\n\n**What I haven't checked**\n- Whether the caliper formula exists, and which version it pins. I only listed the top-level folders.\n- How the tap learns about a release. The branch name suggests a \"notify the tap\" step, but that step isn't in `main` today, so releases may not update the formula yet.\n- The release PR (#217) is open, and the release workflow has a semantic-crates publishing fix (#221) that landed recently. I haven't looked at whether a release has gone out.\n\n**What I'd do next, if you want it**\n1. Read the tap's `Formula/` and its scripts to see how checksums are pinned and updated.\n2. Add the install line (`brew install orin-dx/tap/caliper`) to the README and the site once the formula is confirmed.\n3. Wire the release workflow to notify the tap, if that isn't already done.\n\nDo you want me to start with the formula check?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":677,"cache_read_input_tokens":881383,"output_tokens":586,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_token