{"type":"bridge-session","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","bridgeSessionId":"cse_01D7CJmXuD2ASqfBYm7Lk4WZ","lastSequenceNum":21749,"ownerAccountUuid":"138d593e-e185-4f72-89f2-82e1a501f134","ownerOrganizationUuid":"602db9b4-428d-49e6-a99c-64152cc62a79"}
{"parentUuid":"807c05f1-fa2c-4642-8daa-b5e05fe4af95","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgRBLgnHLb1yTJtiU5VhB","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"`parity-triage` is resumed with about 100 more tool calls, and a clearer plan. The first thing it found is that `MenuTrigger` is fixed (`68c62e1f`). That fix is by shape: a call to a same-file function whose declared return type is a React element counts as render evidence. It has five exact tests, and the other corpora show no other lost or gained components.\n\n**What's still unclassified**, and what the fork will do about it:\n1. **Use only current numbers.** The earlier verdicts may predate the `MenuTrigger` fix, so it re-dispatches Parity on the current branch tip first. It may add a `corpora` input to the dispatch so a re-check takes minutes.\n2. **Name the second lost fixture component.** The oracle shows 32 of 40 components against a baseline of 33. It builds the baseline-commit binary in a scratch directory, extracts the fixtures with both builds, and diffs the component lists. #209's narrowed evidence is the prime suspect, and may also explain Spectrum's component drop from 77.20% to 76.19%.\n3. **Classify every remaining row** with before and after examples:\n   - Chakra's utility types (1 → 1,127) and `& string` (0 → 40).\n   - Rest parameters. The loose `...` pattern also matches TypeScript's own \"… N more …\" elision, so it gets tightened to a strict match with a test.\n   - `readonly` lost. That's a known unimplemented follow-up of #233, so it is classified as a known gap unless something changed it.\n   - Mantine's `X[\"k\"]` growth (6,542 → 6,614): it finds the 72 new props.\n   - Spectrum's same-text drop (67.42% → 63.03%), shadcn's matched drop (95.29% → 95.23%), and antd's `typeof` (7 → 8).\n   - Real regressions get a fix by shape with exact tests.\n4. **Refresh the two baselines** in their own commit, only for rows classified as improvement, acceptable or known gap, with a per-row table in the PR body. Real unfixed regressions stay failing and are listed.\n5. **Mark #234 ready** only if the Parity workflow passes on the final tip. Otherwise it says exactly which gate fails and why.\n\n**Note on what this means for merging.** #234 is a draft stacked on #224. Until the gates pass, I'd merge #224 (its install and guard are correct) and leave #234. The accuracy rows it's still checking are the ones that could hide a regression from the recent batch.\n\nRunning: `parity-triage` and `react-props`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5082,"cache_read_input_tokens":933076,"output_tokens":850,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5082,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":850,"cache_read_input_tokens":933076,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5082,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5082},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"9540b285-36e7-484e-93aa-3dd0e3f5215d","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgRBLgLztdsJ6SWCbbFEX","requestRef":"39e57f95-7978-4919-a152-b0eb83036a4e","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"68cda98e-ff5a-42c5-9d8f-bff42ac339cc","timestamp":"2026-10-26T16:39:51.868Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","version":"2.1.3