-draft PR with base `main` and a short body ending with `https://claude.ai/code/REDACTED`, and then survey all open PRs (`gh pr list`, `gh pr checks`) to produce a bottom-up merge order and a reconcile plan (ADR 0022 renumbering, cache-schema 25 collision, allow-list entries) — likely by resuming/starting a reconcile fork with the house rules (changeset style, stacking, push before finishing).\n\nIf you need specific details from before compaction (like exact code snippets, error messages, or content you generated), read the full transcript at: /Users/gabe/.claude/projects/-Users-gabe-Projects-caliper--claude-worktrees-release-0-2-0/ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675.jsonl\nContinue the conversation from where it left off without asking the user any further questions. Resume directly — do not acknowledge the summary, do not recap what was happening, do not preface with \"I'll continue\" or similar. Pick up the last task as if the break never happened.\n\nThe messages after this summary are the most recent messages from before compaction, kept verbatim. The summary was written without seeing them, so something it says has not happened yet may already have happened in them."},"isVisibleInTranscriptOnly":true,"isCompactSummary":true,"uuid":"44008b67-0943-49d9-a0da-8a306139db68","timestamp":"2026-10-26T17:15:15.955Z","turnPosition":{"promptIndex":202,"turnIndex":317},"turnOrigin":"human","session_id":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","version":"2.1.308","gitBranch":"ci/notify-homebrew-tap","slug":"purring-snuggling-matsumoto"}
