{"parentUuid":"cb885c4f-ebf5-4ec4-8e24-6a540b39d296","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"task_reminder","content":[{"id":"40","subject":"Type-parameter defaults (fillMissingTypeArguments)","description":"Record `= Default` per type parameter (SourceData, cache schema bump), index it, fill missing args in build_substitution incl. no-arg references; loader loads default refs. Measure: Spectrum unbound handlers, csstype TTime.","activeForm":"Adding type-parameter defaults","status":"completed","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"41","subject":"Lib types as data: distributive conditionals, intersection_of, one assignability","description":"Evaluate distributive conditionals so Exclude/Extract come from lib.es5; NonNullable via T & {} reduction in a normalizing intersection_of; unify assignability helpers; remove name-based evaluate_filter. Keep perf.","activeForm":"Evaluating lib types from their definitions","status":"completed","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"42","subject":"Keep syntax we drop: rest/optional params, readonly, index signatures, RefObject","description":"PropType/CollectedType changes per ADR 0002 manual serialization; output schema version.","activeForm":"Keeping dropped syntax","status":"pending","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"43","subject":"Share identical resolved types (intern PropType in ParsedProp)","description":"Chakra+deps peak RSS 359 MiB (#140) -> ~500 (#144+). 470k props, ~1.2k distinct types. Intern PropType per run (Arc), measure memory/time on all corpora.","activeForm":"Interning resolved types","status":"completed","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]}],"itemCount":4},"type":"attachment","uuid":"27af09ba-231a-45be-a25e-c4ea57bbe3c7","timestamp":"2026-10-26T17:16:09.004Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\nThe task tools haven't been used recently. If you're working on tasks that would benefit from tracking progress, consider using TaskCreate to add new tasks and TaskUpdate to update task status (set to in_progress when starti