{"parentUuid":"02e17e94-ace8-453d-b001-3faec8d90949","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgREWEJTnoVVKUByx9pz8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"You're right. I stacked by base branch and never checked that PRs sharing ADR 0022 and cache schema 25 depended on each other, so they conflict now that #217 and #224–#227 have merged.\n\nA fork is fixing them one at a time, in this order: #228, #234, #230, #231, #229, #232, #233, #235, #236.\n\n- **Per PR:** it merges the parent branch (no force-push), resolves conflicts, and drops allow-list entries, since `main` now enforces an empty list.\n- **Dependencies:** wherever one PR depends on an unmerged one (#233 on #232, #229 on #233), it retargets the base and renumbers the ADR and cache schema so each is unique in merge order.\n- **Reporting:** it reports a table of base, merge state and CI state per PR.\n- **Merging:** it won't merge anything.\n\nMain's CI is green so far. I'll report when the fork finishes."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1315,"cache_read_input_tokens":109964,"output_tokens":303,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1315,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":303,"cache_read_input_tokens":109964,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1315,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1315},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"3c58bd5c-fdd5-4fb9-a0d4-ce073924c851","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgREWDz6nNsfjFBVcCVtD","requestRef":"59c0de52-6a17-4584-b152-04f31ba7b41a"