{"type":"queue-operation","operation":"enqueue","timestamp":"2026-10-26T17:36:18.826Z","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","content":"<task-notification>\n<task-id>b29mn4ukv</task-id>\n<tool-use-id>toolu_01GfvDhgxvE6eysURYEuQki3</tool-use-id>\n<output-file>/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-gabe-Projects-caliper--claude-worktrees-release-0-2-0/ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675/tasks/b29mn4ukv.output</output-file>\n<status>completed</status>\n<summary>Background command \"Run the oracle stage\" completed (exit code 0)</summary>\n</task-notification>"}
