{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","hash":"b7364ceb9d94394dc281d4026cfe5d086ad4968dc87ad4d86827316281084b61","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Dd4TWJ7T1Wx9P5j1DPM5Xk","name":"SendMessage","input":{"to":"ad5269bcad04ba5a7","message":"Chase the leftovers; don't allow-list real regressions. Fix the 516 notable-removed (shadcn button attributes), the 95 `X & X` intersections (dedupe identical members at the source), and the 384 prop-field-changed; investigate diagnostic churn and the oracle matched-rate drop (82.5→77.5 fixtures). Allow-list only genuinely intended HTML-layer differences, narrowly (no blanket wildcards; main enforces an empty list, so entries must be dropped on merge — note them in the PR body). Also remember the reconcile-open-prs fork will merge main/parents into #235 later; push your work to fix/react-props-never-omitted without force and say when done. Gates must pass: equivalence, oracle, CI. Report a table of before/after counts."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
