{"parentUuid":"d1a99181-1cda-459d-8af8-bbfeea381859","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgRJPapmAi612tgiFhDzA","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Seven PRs are now mergeable with green CI: #228–#232, #234 and #236. #233 and #235 were still waiting on their last runs when the fork stopped. Nothing was force-pushed or merged.\n\n| PR | Base | State |\n|---|---|---|\n| #228, #230, #231, #234, #236 | main | clean, green |\n| #229 | main | green; allow-list rewritten to 51 narrow entries; cache schema 25 |\n| #232 | main | green; ADR 0022 |\n| #233 | #229's branch | 1 run pending; cache schema 26; ADR 0023; 7 allow-list entries |\n| #235 | #232's branch | 5 runs pending; ADR 0024; 2,084 allow-list entries |\n\n**Merge order:** #228, #234, #230, #231, #229, #233 (retarget it to main first), #232, #235, #236.\n\n**Open items:**\n- **#235 Scorecard speed gate fails.** `full` as the default makes the run without dependency loading slower than main. Mantine takes 240 ms against 153 ms, and Chakra 210 ms against 103 ms, versus the gate's 1.1× limit. This confirms the cost the `react-props` fork measured earlier.\n- **#235 is still being fixed.** The `react-props` fork is chasing its real equivalence regressions, so the 2,084-entry allow-list will shrink or change. The reconcile fork's #235 state will be stale once it pushes.\n- **#235 Install check.** It failed with a 404 because the 0.7.0 npm platform packages weren't published yet. A rerun after the release finishes should clear it.\n- **Allow-list cleanup.** `main` must have an empty allow-list. After #229, #230, #233, #234 and #235 land, each needs a follow-up that empties it, or the \"Allow-list empty\" check on `main` fails.\n- **README collision.** The `docs/adr/README.md` lines for 0022 and 0023 will collide when #232 and #233 merge.\n- **Possible regression on #229.** The \"skipped candidate\" diagnostics for `StyledGroup` and `VisuallyHidden` disappear, and neither shows up as a new component. I haven't looked into it.\n- **#239.** It looks like another release PR, and it isn't ours.\n\nDecision for you on #235: accept the speed cost and relax or override the gate for this PR, or keep the old curated default. I'd keep the old default unless the gate is relaxed on purpose, because `full` costs 9–31% more time and 12–37% more memory than the old default.\n\nresult: Seven PRs are mergeable with green CI: #228–#232, #234 and #236. #233 is restacked on #229 with one run pending. #235 still fails its Scorecard speed gate and has its equivalence fixes in progress, so it needs your call on `full`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2517,"cache_read_input_tokens":118821,"output_tokens":943,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2517,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":943,"cache_read_input_tokens":118821,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2517,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2517},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.2.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"}],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"7fd2ca61-2d4b-4422-9203-8ccd6475358e","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgRJPaSvvZRBzNgoH8kex","requestRef":"2401febb-0784-4bac-a156-dec92dc80f81","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"6277d962-4779-4283-81cc-78f5e96906d9","timestamp":"2026-10-26T18:12:18.301Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","sessionKind":"bg","u