{"parentUuid":"c96a1999-d4e2-4949-aeca-0ffe9290a292","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgRKnejAfchMQ2C3oaX6F","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"#235 is now green: all 17 CI checks pass, including Equivalence. It stays gated on your decision about `full`.\n\n- **Fixed at the source:** identical types written twice now merge, and `A & (A | B)` collapses to `A`. That clears the Spectrum `date` and Chakra and antd `children`/`style` regressions. Unresolved names inside `@types/react` are now info, not warnings, so a plain project shows no default warnings.\n- **Scoped, not fixed:**\n  - **Dropped attributes:** 516 shadcn attributes disappear because `Pick` and `Omit` are now honored, so the old output was wrong.\n  - **Field changes:** the `declarations` and `parent` changes are intended.\n  - **Allow-list:** these sit in 100 corpus- and prop-scoped allow-list entries, and `main` must drop them after the merge.\n- **Scorecard pin:** I did not fix the speed gate. The fork pinned it to `--html-attributes none` so it times the resolver on the same work as main. With attributes listed it was 1.57× on Mantine and 2.05× on Chakra against the 1.1× limit.\n- **Still failing locally:** the oracle matched-rate gate. The parent build gives the same counts, and the committed baseline is stale for these corpora. Wrong rate is 0.00%.\n- **Still open:** `ref` on antd `Breadcrumb` and Spectrum `TreeView` needs an extractor change. `PurePanel`'s 33 props look like a harness pairing mismatch.\n\nDecision for you: `full` costs 7–34% more time than the old default. Merge #235 with `full` as the default and that cost recorded in ADR 0024, or hold it and keep curated?\n\nBranch cleanup is unchanged: the `rc-*` and `scratch/*` branches are mine to list, and remote deletion is yours.\n\nresult: #235 is green on all 17 CI checks. The reconcile fork already left #228–#232, #234 and #236 mergeable, and #233 restacked on #229. The remaining call is yours: accept the 7–34% cost of `full` as the default, or keep curated."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3038,"cache_read_input_tokens":121338,"output_tokens":714,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3038,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":714,"cache_read_input_tokens":121338,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3038,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3038},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.2.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"}],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"dd3ff31f-d529-4d4a-9b2e-4f81452aee81","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgRKneRp2DLRK9pP8FTS1","requestRef":"84815dba-371d-4716-a642-af4f52114b81","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"7fed692c-6d1a-43cc-a1a3-5cdae5016303","timestamp":"2026-10-26T18:30:38.249Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","version":"2.1.308","gitBranch":"rc-233","slug":"purring-snuggling-matsumoto"}
