{"parentUuid":"29c094a9-d1e7-4852-a383-a9f2d7b18ed6","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgRQ8ZjYy27GmaKeLAvdd","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The auto-update work is done and waiting on your merge. PR #236 is open against `main`, mergeable, with 15 checks and none failing.\n\n- **What it does:** after a CLI release, `release.yml` finds the `npm/caliper-docgen@*` tag on the release commit and calls the `notify-homebrew-tap` action. That dispatches `tool_released` to `orin-dx/homebrew-tap`, which verifies the npm archives and opens a formula PR for you to approve.\n- **If it fails:** the step is `continue-on-error`, so a failed notification never fails a release, and the tap's daily check covers it.\n- **Already in place:** the GitHub App client ID and private key you set up, and the action from orin-dx/actions#2.\n\nThe first real test is the next CLI release that publishes `caliper-docgen`. The release PR #217 is merged and #239 looks like a new one, so that release should come soon. If the tap stays quiet after it, check the notify step's log first.\n\nI haven't run the notifier end to end.\n\nresult: Tap auto-update PR #236 is green and mergeable on `main`. Once it merges, the next CLI release notifies `orin-dx/homebrew-tap`, which opens a formula PR for you to approve. It hasn't been tested against a real release."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":336,"cache_read_input_tokens":128110,"output_tokens":421,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":336,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":421,"cache_read_input_tokens":128110,"cache_creation_input_tokens":336,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":336},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"684416d7-bb88-4fc2-a0ed-573eca13958b","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgRQ8ZSSk45Z5KxdD7Eob","requestRef":"1aa7fd03-1491-4d22-a9c4-31db11b3cf1a","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"9e280aae-bfbe-4fc7-aa0c-f1e2caaa1eec","timestamp":"2026-10-26T19:27:34.381Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","version":"2.1.308","gitBranch":"rc-233","slug":"purring-snuggling-matsumoto"}
