{"parentUuid":"a3faf591-7f73-4604-8b3c-8faae981be3e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgRQBtu4qX8rMMmcnfmXY","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Estimate: `full` as default costs roughly 10% of our speed lead over RDT and about 20% of our memory lead. Caliper stays around 27× faster than RDT. These numbers are scaled from earlier parity baselines, not freshly measured.\n\n| Corpus | Speed vs RDT (old default) | With `full` | `full` cost on us |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Mantine | ~24× | ~22× | +10% wall |\n| Chakra | ~45× | ~41× | +11% |\n| shadcn | ~35× | ~27× | +31% |\n| antd | ~28× | ~26× | +11% |\n| Spectrum | ~17× | ~15.5× | +9% |\n| Median | ~28–31× | ~27× | |\n\n- **Memory vs RDT:** the median lead drops from about 4.5× to about 3.6×, since peak RSS is +12% to +37%.\n- **Against react-docgen:** I estimate our compute lead slips from 5–15× to about 4.5–13×. This is the weakest number. The only measured point is the Node harness, where startup dominates.\n- **Output size:** canonical JSON grows 42–105%, and the RDT-shaped snapshots go from 0.35 MB to 6.4 MB. Interning doesn't shrink them.\n- **What `full` buys:** matching RDT's `@types/react` props. That is what shadcn (~40% recall against RDT) and antd (~80%) lack, and the main gap behind the handlers you flagged. Mantine, Chakra and Spectrum are already at 98.6–99.7%. I haven't measured the recall gain under `full`.\n\nI should have said last turn that `full` is slower and bigger than the old default, not faster and smaller as you assumed. The shadcn row is the big cost. There is a middle path: `full` only when a component needs the attributes, or interned shared attribute sets, which would target shadcn's 31%.\n\nI can launch a fork to measure instead of estimate. It would run RDT, react-docgen, old default and `full` on all five corpora for time, peak RSS and recall, and try the lazy attribute layer on shadcn. Should I start it?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":99,"cache_read_input_tokens":128867,"output_tokens":1271,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":553},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":99,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1271,"cache_read_input_tokens":128867,"cache_creation_input_tokens":99,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":99},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"056bafd9-1ec9-4d68-bf9c-cec06784b64b","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgRQBtcgyhhhdvHqtd2yM","requestRef":"fc8d232a-d485-4e16-a412-812154c6d2ba","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"59484511-c80e-4550-866d-341fa4cdd0bc","timestamp":"2026-10-26T19:28:29.058Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","version":"2.1.308","gitBranch":"rc-233","slug":"purring-snuggling-matsumoto"}
