{"parentUuid":"dc515784-13ff-4088-8bcb-2d563d471103","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgRQLxpTJ8xwXDHuuLD9F","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":96,"cache_read_input_tokens":131001,"output_tokens":1176,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":553},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":96,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1176,"cache_read_input_tokens":131001,"cache_creation_input_tokens":96,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":96},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":5307,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"bcee8ab3-dac0-4a3b-bc95-d3027a1cd220","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgRQLxTsJVHq1Lkpxy3K6","requestRef":"a99c1905-fa5d-44a6-8401-22494a61211e","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"59794d09-9a0c-435d-9bdd-1b439f1443b0","timestamp":"2026-10-26T19:30:25.037Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","version":"2.1.308","gitBranch":"rc-233","slug":"purring-snuggling-matsumoto"}
{"parentUuid":"59794d09-9a0c-435d-9bdd-1b439f1443b0","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgRQLxpTJ8xwXDHuuLD9F","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"No. We never separated the cost of the attribute layer from the rest of resolution, so I can't say how much \"only when needed\" would save.\n\n- **It's already per component.** The attribute layer is added only when a component's props actually extend a React or DOM type, such as `ComponentProps<'div'>`. shadcn pays 31% because nearly all its components do. A \"when needed\" test therefore won't skip much there.\n- **Storybook already pays per story.** The lazy session resolves one component per story, so `full` costs a few milliseconds for the component being shown. The +9% to +31% figures come from the eager whole-corpus extract, which isn't how Storybook runs. I haven't measured the per-story cost under `full`, so it may be far smaller than those figures suggest.\n- **The cost is volume.** The fork found a name cache changed nothing, and around 195 props per component are copied, merged and serialized. A user who needs only `onClick` pays for 195.\n\nOptions, cheapest first:\n1. **Measure the Storybook path.** Compare first-story and later-story latency, old default against `full`. If the cost is only a few milliseconds there, keep `full` for Storybook and leave eager extracts alone.\n2. **Share the layer.** Resolve the attribute set once per element type (`div`, `button`) and have components refer to it. This is the same idea as ADR 0018, and it cuts time, memory and JSON size together.\n3. **Choose the mode by entry point.** Storybook and agents default to `full`. The bulk CLI defaults to the old mode, with `full` one flag away. This is the quick fallback, but the default then differs by tool.\n4. **Decide per component whether it's needed.** I don't recommend this. It's heuristic, and we've already regretted dropping attributes by guesswork.\n\nI'd go with 1 then 2. Should I start a fork to measure the Storybook path first and prototype the shared layer?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":96,"cache_read_input_tokens":131001,"output_tokens":1176,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":553},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":96,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1176,"cache_read_input_tokens":131001,"cache_creation_input_tokens":96,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":96},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"bcee8ab3-dac0-4a3b-bc95-d3027a1cd220","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgRQLxTsJVHq1Lkpxy3K6","requestRef":"a99c1905-fa5d-44a6-8401-22494a61211e","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"5aca4da1-9cbf-41c5-84b7-255386b85b1b","timestamp":"2026-10-26T19:30:30.161Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","version":"2.1.308","gitBranch":"rc-233","slug":"purring-snuggling-matsumoto"}
