{"parentUuid":"e49d09b6-7763-4924-82d4-57d0d93c21ee","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgRWxDzvxqsZ1fiuDXhKb","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The calibration run has started in a fork.\n\n- **Runs:** it builds current `main` once, then runs the proposed method (interleaved, 15 runs per side, median wall time and peak memory) base against base, 20 times on each of the five corpora. It does this locally and on a GitHub Actions ubuntu runner, using a temporary `workflow_dispatch` workflow on `scratch/gate-calibration`.\n- **Report:** per corpus, the spread of head/base ratios for time and memory, and the false-positive rate at 1.05, 1.10 and 1.15. It will also say whether the re-run-once rule is needed, and recommend thresholds and a run count, plus how the CI runner differs from this machine.\n- **Scope:** no repo code changes beyond the scratch workflow, no PR, and nothing merged. I'll give you the remote-branch delete command at the end.\n\nI'll report when it finishes."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1057,"cache_read_input_tokens":152542,"output_tokens":299,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1057,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":299,"cache_read_input_tokens":152542,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1057,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1057},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"30f9e555-6cd5-46cf-a118-b5f7edebac7b","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgRWxDebmr55QWrBeJoXx","requestRef":"badc14ef-c7d1-49