{"parentUuid":"eb1736f5-0b54-4d04-b762-3632ae05fee9","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgRjUfwPm1dQHBSvzt9Gb","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes. Everything is mergeable and clean except #241, #240 and #239, whose CI is still pending. Merge bottom-up in this order:\n\n1. **#228, #234, #230, #231, #236:** independent, based on `main`, clean.\n2. **#229:** on `main`. After it merges, retarget #233 to `main`.\n3. **#233:** on #229's branch. Retarget it before you merge.\n4. **#232:** on `main`.\n5. **#235:** on #232's branch. Retarget it to `main` after #232 merges. Its Scorecard speed gate needs your call first (details below).\n6. **#241:** on #235's branch. It can go with #235. Wait for its CI.\n7. **#240:** the docs cleanup. Merge it last, because it conflicts trivially with #232, #233 and #235 in the ADR README and `STATUS.md`. If you merge it earlier, expect one-line resolutions.\n8. **#239:** the release PR. Merge it after everything above.\n\nYour account has `delete_branch_on_merge` on, so merging a parent should retarget its children to `main` automatically. Check each child's base afterwards.\n\n**Follow-up after the merges** (`main` enforces an empty allow-list):\n- Drop the allow-list entries from #229, #230, #233, #234 and #235, in one small PR. Until that lands the \"Allow-list empty\" check fails on `main`.\n- Retire ADRs 0023 and 0024 (and 0013 with 0024).\n\n**Decision for you:** #235's Scorecard speed gate fails by design. With #241 stacked, `full` is much cheaper, so it may now pass; the fork pinned the scorecard to `--html-attributes none` to sidestep it. I'd merge #235 and #241 together.\n\n**What's next, in order:**\n1. **Gate implementation:** three deletion PRs per the proposal, using the calibrated thresholds: speed gate (1.10× wall, 1.20× memory, 9 runs), output diff without the allow-list, weekly accuracy record with react-docgen.\n2. **Release:** let #239 ship, which exercises the Homebrew notifier for the first time.\n3. **Quality gaps:** `ref` on antd `Breadcrumb` and Spectrum `TreeView`, `readonly` and index signatures (task #42), and Chakra's `NonNullable<union>`.\n4. **Audit `apps/validate`:** about 1,990 lines.\n5. **Branch cleanup:** the remote deletes I can't run: `git push origin --delete scratch/gate-calibration scratch/parity-allow-probe`, plus the earlier list.\n\nShould I start on the gate implementation PRs as soon as the stack lands?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":772,"cache_read_input_tokens":157851,"output_tokens":902,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":772,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":902,"cache_read_input_tokens":157851,"cache_creation_input_tokens":772,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":772},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"543ccf9d-1fa1-4412-9101-05127c402b92","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgRjUffWpwzRqh5MsboDx","requestRef":"b0e4659f-a9c7-4593-92d6-c8af73932b58","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"9a43a2b8-3743-4554-ac0b-5f4372e47ba0","timestamp":"2026-10-26T23:41:16.948Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","version":"2.1.308","gitBranch":"docs/cleanup-stale-docs-adrs","slug":"purring-snuggling-matsumoto"}
