{"parentUuid":"e9e1ed94-940d-4585-91d9-a04e05706d2a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgRjkAodhmtxGR9gRzmkX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"You're right. I told the `forwardref-detection` fork to branch off `main`, which could conflict with #228, #229 and #233, all of which edit the extractor. I have now told the fork to stack and prove it before pushing.\n\n- **Stacking:** it must base its branch on the open PR that touches its files, the top of the chain if there are several, and set the PR base to that branch, not `main`. For extractor files that is #233's branch, which sits on #229's.\n- **Conflict check:** before pushing, it must trial-merge against every open PR head and `main`. Any conflict means re-stack or move the change.\n- **Tests:** new tests go in a new module, not appended to `extractor/tests.rs`.\n- **PR body:** it must say which PR it depends on and the merge order.\n\n**Audit result:** the `validate-audit` fork finished. Details are in `$CLAUDE_JOB_DIR/tmp/validate-audit.md`.\n- **Keep:** the TS 7.1 oracle, about 760 lines. The weekly oracle run uses it and it found real bugs on 10-23 and 10-24.\n- **Delete:** the July fixtures harness, about 1,250 lines. Nothing in CI, the justfile or `scripts/` runs it, and its last substantive change was 2026-07-25.\n- **Fold first:** move `run-react-docgen.ts` (about 60 lines) to `scripts/parity-rdg.mjs`, then delete the harness. It's the only place react-docgen runs.\n- **Net:** about 1,990 lines becomes about 800.\n- **Trade-off:** deleting `run-semantic.ts` loses the check that the TS algorithm still reproduces RDT on a new beta. The audit judged the backend's own tests sufficient.\n- **Caveat:** \"unused\" came from grep and git history. Nothing was run.\n\n**Held until the stack merges:** the `apps/validate` deletion PR, since it also touches the scripts and workflows the stack edits.\n\nI'll report when the `forwardref-detection` fork finishes, including which PR it stacked on."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":639,"cache_read_input_tokens":165404,"output_tokens":690,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":639,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":690,"cache_read_input_tokens":165404,"cache_creation_input_tokens":639,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":639},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"5581996b-1b60-41c2-9741-221883aee835","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgRjkAY1YsfEe5jSjHkYZ","requestRef":"ba92cdb8-65f3-49bd-886d-945264bdc753","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"15ff557a-b8ea-43cc-8c09-704c56a3de4c","timestamp":"2026-10-26T23:44:45.659Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","version":"2.1.308","gitBranch":"fix/forwardref-shape","slug":"purring-snuggling-matsumoto"}
