{"type":"api-request","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","id":"3a3afc1d-1dd3-46f7-a67c-a397a5e3e6a6","timestamp":"2026-10-26T23:58:08.959Z","version":"2.1.308","querySource":"repl_main_thread:outputStyle:Concise","shapeHash":"30de49787603a257f4975e5cdab983aad4d3f56db15b3d01afad71bede0d6239","params":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","betas":["claude-code-20250219","oauth-2025-04-20","interleaved-thinking-2025-05-14","thinking-token-count-2026-05-13","context-management-2025-06-27","prompt-caching-scope-2026-01-05","per-turn-control-2026-07-01","mid-conversation-tool-changes-2026-07-01","inline-tools-2026-09-15","advisor-tool-2026-03-01","advanced-tool-use-2025-11-20","mid-conversation-system-clear-at-2026-08-21","effort-2025-11-24","dangerous-tool-use-2026-09-03","thinking-binding-controls-2026-08-01","thinking-display-updates-2026-08-18","afk-mode-2026-01-31","extended-cache-ttl-2025-04-11","cache-diagnosis-2026-04-07","message-threads-2026-08-12"],"max_tokens":128000,"thinking":{"type":"adaptive","display":"updates"},"context_management":{"edits":[{"type":"clear_thinking_20251015","keep":"all"}]},"output_config":{"effort":"medium"}},"base":"40c89b63-3b71-4310-a426-f0ba07292f7c","keep":173,"tail":["939e1bf6a1a668c2650fa70eb593439e66367a08a86a74bbea2a3ba38cfdae96","633fa2e1707e6938ae58e4e06b688c1c5a3fb294881a0ff783885d00331ce469","fb4471e8bedb91179aa9093301182cbd8d51001a17e67887ea7779bf54ff4869"],"cacheControl":[{"path":["system",1],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h","scope":"global"}},{"path":["system",2],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}},{"path":["messages",175,"content",0],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}}],"requestDigest":"233193e2c4c61b6eb7e3e4961ea5912ddac36d3cec22ee54bd53b0d46eeebbc1"}
{"parentUuid":"64bb0ac7-fcff-4805-8240-b0dd1465c3bc","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgRkmkuNGFyVCQ9JL2KYa","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The red CI traces to a broken merge in `crates/core/src/extractor/tests.rs`, and the stacking fork is fixing it now. I haven't seen the failing logs yet, because those runs were still in progress.\n\n**Failing right now:**\n- **Lint on #229 and #241:** it fails in about 50 seconds, which points to a compile or formatting break.\n- **Coverage on #233 and #235:** it fails in about a minute, which points to the test build breaking.\n- **Entire Gates on #243 and #240:** a check hosted outside GitHub (`entire.com/gh/orin-dx/caliper/trails/34`). I don't know yet what it gates or why it fails.\n- **#244:** no failures reported, but it has pending checks and sits on the broken #241.\n\n**Cause (probable, not confirmed):** the unclosed function in `extractor/tests.rs` came from merging #228's test and #229's test together. It starts at #229 and carries up the chain through #233, #235 and #241 into #244. The earlier reconcile fork and the stacking fork both merge into these branches, so the stack is also re-running CI as they push.\n\n**What I've asked the stacking fork to do:**\n1. Repair the break at its origin, not only on #241, and push without force.\n2. Find out what Entire Gates checks and fix it, or report back.\n3. Keep going until CI is green on every PR head. A passing merge simulation is not enough.\n\nI'll report when it finishes with a table of CI state per PR."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":518,"cache_read_input_tokens":180592,"output_tokens":491,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":518,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":491,"cache_read_input_tokens":180592,"cache_creation_input_tokens":518,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":518},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"498155ac-7561-4018-88d7-634e171065e0","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgRkmkZnrtc8aqybgPBsK","requestRef":"3a3afc1d-1dd3-46f7-a67c-a397a5e3e6a6","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"4dfd2187-3e38-4ccf-9eb5-b6bf2d9373c6","timestamp":"2026-10-26T23:58:13.261Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","version":"2.1.308","gitBranch":"fix/forwardref-by-shape","slug":"purring-snuggling-matsumoto"}
