{"type":"bridge-session","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","bridgeSessionId":"cse_01D7CJmXuD2ASqfBYm7Lk4WZ","lastSequenceNum":21749,"ownerAccountUuid":"138d593e-e185-4f72-89f2-82e1a501f134","ownerOrganizationUuid":"602db9b4-428d-49e6-a99c-64152cc62a79"}
{"parentUuid":"4a47de30-b569-44c4-81d9-43cda560fdef","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgRnc2XvaTaynCPEuw2F9","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"CI is still red on #229, #233, #235 and #241, and it has moved: Lint and Coverage now pass, and a different set of checks fails.\n\n| PR | Failing now |\n|---|---|\n| #229 | Test / Rust, and the overall CI check |\n| #233 | Equivalence |\n| #235 | Equivalence |\n| #241 | Equivalence, Entire Gates |\n| #244 | none yet, with 17 checks pending |\n| #243, #240 | none now; Entire Gates, which failed on both earlier, no longer shows as failing |\n| #228, #230, #231, #232, #234, #236 | no failures, with 1–2 checks pending on each |\n\n**What this means:**\n- **#229** is the root of the chain. Its test build is failing, and #233, #235, #241 and #244 sit on top of it, so fix it first.\n- **Equivalence on #233, #235 and #241** is likely a side effect of the allow-list move: their entries are moving into per-PR files, and the check may be reading both places. That's a guess; I haven't read those logs.\n- **Entire Gates on #241** is the same external check that failed on #243 and #240 earlier. It's unexplained so far.\n- The stacking fork is still waiting on its own CI watchers for #229, #235 and #244, and it hasn't reported a cause.\n\nI haven't merged anything. Hold off merging until all of these are green. I'll read the failing logs for #229 and the Equivalence runs as soon as they finish, and report the causes."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":681,"cache_read_input_tokens":182784,"output_tokens":496,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":681,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":