{"parentUuid":"1e34c801-7c98-42cf-91ff-a5dd5da68ecf","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgRoagFsawgUD3vAeKrpu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"No check is failing on any open PR now. The stacking fork pushed repaired heads for #233, #235 and #241, and CI is re-running on them.\n\n- **Running:** 16–17 checks are pending on each of #233, #235, #241 and #244, and 1 on #229.\n- **Mergeable with a single check pending:** #228, #230, #231, #232, #234, #236 and #229. (#228 isn't shown in the latest listing, so I can't confirm its state.)\n- **Done:** #243 and #240 have no failures and nothing pending, but both show BLOCKED. That is probably required checks not satisfied or review required, and I haven't checked which. #239, the release PR, shows UNSTABLE with nothing failing or pending, which I haven't looked into either.\n\nGreen is not confirmed until those runs finish. The fork is waiting on #233 and #241 and will recheck the rest, and I'll report its final table and the merge order. Hold off merging until then."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":658,"cache_read_input_tokens":184481,"output_tokens":315,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":658,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":315,"cache_read_input_tokens":184481,"cache_creation_input_tokens":658,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":658},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"4e4e7172-da09-4483-b243-cdc6c9b28fd4","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgRoafwGitFh4GoLGMb