.ai/code/REDACTED`. Never merge PRs, never force-push; sandbox off for git/gh; one plain git command per call; read exit codes directly. Final report: table PR | base | was behind | conflicts resolved | CI."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":755,"cache_read_input_tokens":195675,"output_tokens":1023,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":107},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":755,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1023,"cache_read_input_tokens":195675,"cache_creation_input_tokens":755,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":755},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01YRVk9doggQiMpNHzbr6uqn":{"description":"Update all PR branches with main","subagent_type":"fork","name":"sync-main","prompt":"Bring every open PR head up to date with latest origin/main, bottom-up, with no force-pushes (the standing rule forbids force-push, so 'rebase' = merge origin/main into the branch; keep history linear-ish by merging main once per branch). Branches behind by 2: fix/forwardref-by-shape(#244), ci/allow-list-directory(#243), perf/component-lookups-by-name(#241), docs/cleanup-stale-docs-adrs(#240), callisto/version-packages(#239, release PR — only merge main if safe, it is Callisto-generated; if it conflicts or is bot-owned, leave it and report), ci/notify-homebrew-tap(#236), fix/react-props-never-omitted(#235), ci/triage-parity-regressions(#234), feat/function-param-flags(#233), feat/semantic-on-demand(#232), feat/tagged-factory-components(#229). #230 and #231 are already up to date. Order: main-based ones first (#243,#23