{"type":"bridge-session","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","bridgeSessionId":"cse_01D7CJmXuD2ASqfBYm7Lk4WZ","lastSequenceNum":21749,"ownerAccountUuid":"138d593e-e185-4f72-89f2-82e1a501f134","ownerOrganizationUuid":"602db9b4-428d-49e6-a99c-64152cc62a79"}
{"parentUuid":"a9001479-95a8-4a89-aba0-cd6b8564fc95","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgS9dZwmhTvttoFdHv1bf","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Every PR head except the release PR is now current with `main`, and the pair test still finds 0 conflicting pairs. Two checks fail and a fork is working on them. The release PR #239 is still 2 commits behind, as I told the fork to leave it.\n\n**State:** CI is still running on most PRs (15–16 checks pending on each). #230 and #231 are the only ones with finished failures.\n\n- **#230, Equivalence:** `scripts/equivalence.py` crashes at line 151 with `KeyError: 'WebkitAppearance'`, so no diff is produced. It's a script crash, not an output difference, and it's deterministic. The fork will find out whether the script mishandles current output or #230 emits a malformed prop-set reference, which would be a product bug fixed in #230's branch. It will add a regression test.\n- **#231, Scorecard:** chakra measured 103 ms against `main`'s 72 ms, a 1.44× result, on a PR that doesn't touch the resolver. I suspect noise from a single sample, but that's unconfirmed. The fork will re-run it up to twice and compare against the calibration. If it is noise, the real answer is the median-of-9 method from the measurement redesign, which isn't built yet.\n\n**Stacking:** #243 also rewrites `equivalence.py`, so the fork stacks any script fix on #243's branch and trial-merges against every open PR head before pushing.\n\nI'll report when it finishes, including the CI state of #230 and #231. Hold off merging until then."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2225,"cache_read_input_tokens":210297,"output_tokens":497,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"eph