{"parentUuid":"ada4a622-a2fc-4fee-a15d-f66a582938ff","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgTnWch5qsQ5d4TiAneBr","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01NaPVxfmGTtPiWctcM9R32a","name":"Agent","input":{"description":"Clear PR conflicts against restore branch","subagent_type":"fork","name":"clear-conflicts","prompt":"Clear merge conflicts on the open PRs, stacking on the history-restore PR #246 (branch restore/main-history; it already contains ab051882 + #245 + latest main with a regenerated pnpm-lock.yaml). Branches: ci/allow-list-directory(#243), docs/cleanup-stale-docs-adrs(#240), feat/semantic-on-demand(#232) are CONFLICTING with main; also bring ci/triage-parity-regressions(#234), ci/notify-homebrew-tap(#236), fix/story-export-of-renamed-component(#231), fix/type-losses(#230), feat/tagged-factory-components(#229) up to date. Then children after their parent: feat/function-param-flags(#233) after #229; fix/react-props-never-omitted(#235) after #232; perf/component-lookups-by-name(#241) after #235; fix/forwardref-by-shape(#244) after #241. For each: in a scratch worktree, `git fetch origin`, merge origin/restore/main-history (NOT main) into the branch so the already-resolved lockfiles carry over; on conflicts resolve keeping both intents; for pnpm-lock.yaml take the restore side and run `pnpm install --lockfile-only` then `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile --lockfile-only`; for Cargo.lock run `cargo metadata --locked` (regenerate with `cargo update -w` if needed). Before pushing each branch: `cargo test -p caliper-docgen-core --no-run` exit 0 and `cargo fmt --check`. Push without force. Do NOT touch #239 (Callisto-generated release PR; report only), #247 (duplicate of #246; report only) or #248 (dependabot). Finish with: `python3 -I $CLAUDE_JOB_DIR/tmp/pairs.py` and `sim_merge.py` (put 246 first in its ORDER as origin/restore/main-history, then the rest) both clean, and `gh pr view` mergeable per PR. Note Equivalence/Scorecard will stay red until #246 merges (they compare against the rewound main) — do NOT allow-list or relax gates to hide it. Commits end `Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/REDACTED`. Never merge PRs or force-push; sandbox off for git/gh/pnpm; one plain git command per call; read exit codes directly. Report a table PR | conflicts resolved | mergeable | remaining failing checks and why."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1407,"cache_read_input_tokens":268557,"output_tokens":2426,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1439},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1407,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2426,"cache_read_input_tokens":268557,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1407,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1407},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01NaPVxfmGTtPiWctcM9R32a":{"description":"Clear PR conflicts against restore branch","subagent_type":"fork","name":"clear-conflicts","prompt":"Clear merge conflicts on the open PRs, stacking on the history-restore PR #246 (branch restore/main-history; it already contains ab051882 + #245 + latest main with a regenerated pnpm-lock.yaml). Branches: ci/allow-list-directory(#243), docs/cleanup-stale-docs-adrs(#240), feat/semantic-on-demand(#232) are CONFLICTING with main; also bring ci/triage-parity-regressions(#234), ci/notify-homebrew-tap(#236), fix/story-export-of-renamed-component(#231), fix/type-losses(#230), feat/tagged-factory-components(#229) up to date. Then children after their parent: feat/function-param-flags(#233) after #229; fix/react-props-never-omitted(#235) after #232; perf/component-lookups-by-name(#241) after #235; fix/forwardref-by-shape(#244) after #241. For each: in a scratch worktree, `git fetch origin`, merge origin/restore/main-history (NOT main) into the branch so the already-resolved lockfiles carry over; on conflicts resolve keeping both intents; for pnpm-lock.yaml take the restore side and run `pnpm install --lockfile-only` then `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile --lockfile-only`; for Cargo.lock run `cargo metadata --locked` (regenerate with `cargo update -w` if needed). Before pushing each branch: `cargo test -p caliper-docgen-core --no-run` exit 0 and `cargo fmt --check`. Push without force. Do NOT touch #239 (Callisto-generated release PR; report only), #247 (duplicate of #246; report only) or #248 (dependabot). Finish with: `python3 -I $CLAUDE_JOB_DIR/tmp/pairs.py` and `sim_merge.py` (put 246 first in its ORDER as origin/restore/main-history, then the rest) both clean, and `gh pr view` mergeable per PR. Note Equivalence/Scorecard will stay red until #246 merges (they compare against the rewound main) — do NOT allow-list or relax gates to hide it. Commits end `Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/REDACTED`. Never merge PRs or force-push; sandbox off for git/gh/pnpm; one plain git command per call; read exit codes directly. Report a table PR | conflicts resolved | mergeable | remaining failing checks and why."}},"serverClassifierRequest":"fdb20cbf-846d-4e43-8c51-cda8d2a248d7","apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011CgTnWcJGXfwHzweLtg2Up","requestRef":"2ad160e0-b3ed-402f-a8a0-b5524e288280","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"d85337e4-1575-4e95-9d14-1ea6263947e0","timestamp":"2026-10-28T01:42:26.391Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/re