{"parentUuid":"fdc9ef5a-a324-41d1-97ae-1e5aaabc3608","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgTpmNhce5MjYWcGRNR1X","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Merge in this order. The simulation passed cleanly in it against the current `main`. It's the order I'd use, not a guarantee, because the `green-the-stack` fork is still updating branches and `main` can move.\n\n| # | PR | Base | Why here |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | #243 allow-list directory | main | First: it changes how the allow-list works, so each later PR's entries live in its own file |\n| 2 | #234 parity triage | main | Independent |\n| 3 | #230 intersection property reads | main | Independent |\n| 4 | #231 story import to renamed component | main | Independent |\n| 5 | #236 Homebrew tap notifier | main | Independent, CI-only |\n| 6 | #229 tagged-factory components | main | Parent of #233 |\n| 7 | #232 TS 7.1 on-demand | main | Parent of #235 |\n| 8 | #233 function-parameter flags | #229's branch | Retarget to `main` after #229 merges |\n| 9 | #235 `full` as default | #232's branch | Retarget to `main` after #232 merges |\n| 10 | #241 component lookups by name | #235's branch | Retarget after #235 |\n| 11 | #244 `forwardRef` by shape | #241's branch | Retarget after #241 |\n| 12 | #240 docs and ADR cleanup | main | Last, because it touches docs files others edit |\n\n**Left out:**\n- **#239:** the release PR. Merge it last, and only after Callisto regenerates it, since it's now behind `main`.\n- **#247:** a duplicate of the restore that #246 already merged. Close it.\n- **#248:** the dependabot oxc bump. It fails Lint, tests and MSRV, and I haven't found out whether that's the bump or the old base. Leave it for now.\n\n**Between merges:**\n- **Retargets:** GitHub should retarget children to `main` automatically when you merge a parent. Check each child's base after.\n- **Up to Date:** after each merge, the next PR may show behind `main` again. Merge `main` into it, or ask me to.\n- **Pair test:** rerun it before the next merge, or ask me to: `python3 -I $CLAUDE_JOB_DIR/tmp/pairs.py`.\n\n**Not green yet:** checks are still running, and some may fail on their merits now that `main` is restored. Don't merge a PR with a red check until the fork reports what each failure is."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":430,"cache_read_input_tokens":280669,"output_tokens":810,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":430,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":810,"cache_read_input_tokens":280669,"cache_creation_input_tokens":430,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":430},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.2.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"}],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"4b972ce3-ae2f-4375-a336-834f0cccb483","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgTpmNGKEXMavuP2cR6JA","requestRef":"b0ab374a-ee85-4b54-91d7-de67b92184f9","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"e06aaab5-94f1-4969-abcd-ae5a0351fcc8","timestamp":"2026-10-28T02:11:48.468Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","version":"2.1.308","gitBranch":"cc-244","slug":"purring-snuggling-matsumoto"}
