%h %G?'` shows G; the PR-only diff (new vs its new base) equals the old PR-only diff (old head vs its old base), ignoring files that differ only because main advanced; `cargo test -p caliper-docgen-core --no-run` exit 0 and `cargo fmt --check` on the stack top; $CLAUDE_JOB_DIR/tmp/pairs.py and sim_merge.py clean. (4) Push each with `git push --force-with-lease=<branch>:<old-sha> origin <newsha>:refs/heads/<branch>`; sandbox OFF for git (gpg needs the agent); NEVER pass --no-gpg-sign or -c commit.gpgsign=false; if signing fails STOP and report. Do not touch main, #239, #247, #248 or any other branch. (5) After pushing, confirm each commit is Verified on GitHub (gh api repos/orin-dx/caliper/commits/<sha> --jq .commit.verification.verified), PR bases unchanged, mergeable state, then wait for CI and report failing checks with causes (do not allow-list to hide). Also check whether branch protection requires signed commits (gh api repos/orin-dx/caliper/branches/main/protection if permitted) and report. Run $CLAUDE_JOB_DIR/tmp/unsigned.py at the end: 0 not-signed-good commits unique to these branches. Remove scratch worktrees. Final report: table PR | old head | new head | signed | verified on GitHub | mergeable | CI."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":76,"cache_read_input_tokens":295466,"output_tokens":1308,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":76,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1308,"cache_read_input_tokens":295466,"cache_creation_input_tokens":76,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":76},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnosti