{"parentUuid":"db131d7e-3c5f-4d6b-b598-055a6b07e414","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgTrx197afHKNxqLH2Rdv","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Wait for the re-sign fork to finish before merging anything else. After that, merge #229 and #232 next.\n\n**Already merged:** #243, #234 and #236 merged by you. #230 and #231 are also no longer open, but I haven't confirmed whether they merged or were closed.\n\n**Why wait:** all the remaining PRs are in the re-sign. The fork is still running and will force-push new heads for #229, #232, #233, #235, #240, #241 and #244. If you merge one of them mid-rewrite, the push can land on top of a merged PR or break its children.\n\n**Order after the fork reports:**\n1. **#229** and **#232**: parents, and based on `main`.\n2. **#233**: retarget to `main` after #229 merges.\n3. **#235**: retarget after #232 merges.\n4. **#241**: after #235.\n5. **#244**: after #241.\n6. **#240**: the docs cleanup, last of this group.\n7. **#239**: the release PR, last overall. It needs Callisto to regenerate it first.\n\n**Not for merging:** #248, the dependabot oxc bump. It has failed Lint, tests and MSRV, and I haven't found out why.\n\n**Signing:** #243, #234 and #236 merged before the re-sign, so their unsigned commits are now on `main`. The re-sign covers only the branches that haven't merged yet. Cleaning `main` itself would need a force-push to `main`, and I won't do that.\n\nI'll report when the fork finishes, with the signed heads and the CI state of each PR."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1203,"cache_read_input_tokens":299262,"output_tokens":1317,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":813},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1203,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens