{"type":"bridge-session","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","bridgeSessionId":"cse_01D7CJmXuD2ASqfBYm7Lk4WZ","lastSequenceNum":21749,"ownerAccountUuid":"138d593e-e185-4f72-89f2-82e1a501f134","ownerOrganizationUuid":"602db9b4-428d-49e6-a99c-64152cc62a79"}
{"parentUuid":"5876805a-104d-461a-a502-1392286b7f3e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgTsPNUhjE3Q5VFHzuUXw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes, the re-sign is done, and no open PR has a failing check or conflict right now except #248. Checks are still running on the others.\n\n**Re-signed:** the seven branches that were still open or merged during the run (#229, #232, #233, #235, #240, #241, #244) were force-pushed, each with a lease pinned to its old head. All seven are Verified on GitHub, and no unsigned commits remain on the open branches. #229, #233 and #240 merged using the new signed commits.\n\n**Method:** the fork's first attempt squashed each branch to one commit. The simulation showed that created conflicts that didn't exist, so it threw that away before pushing. What it pushed re-signs all 91 commits one by one, keeping trees, parents, authors, dates and messages. That differs from the one-commit-per-branch plan, and it was the better call. Old heads are backed up in `$CLAUDE_JOB_DIR/tmp/old-heads.txt`.\n\n**Signed commits are required:** `main`'s ruleset includes `required_signatures`, a merge queue and non-fast-forward. That's why this mattered. The unsigned commits from #243, #234, #236, #230 and #231 merged before the re-sign. I haven't confirmed how the ruleset treated them.\n\n**Open PRs:**\n\n| PR | Base | State |\n|---|---|---|\n| #252 | main | mergeable, 16 checks pending |\n| #232 | main | mergeable, 12 pending |\n| #235 | #232's branch | mergeable, 15 pending |\n| #241 | #235's branch | mergeable, 15 pending |\n| #244 | #241's branch | mergeable, 15 pending |\n| #239 (release) | main | mergeable, 1 pending |\n| #248 (dependabot oxc bump) | main | fails Lint, tests, Coverage and MSRV |\n\n**New:** #252 empties `scripts/equivalence-allow.d/`. Four allow-list files from merged PRs (#229, #230, #233, #234) are on `main`, so the \"Allow-list empty\" check has failed on every `main` commit since #236 merged. Merge #252 first.\n\n**Merge order:** #252, then #232, #235, #241, #244, retargeting each child after its parent merges, then #239.\n\n**#248:** the oxc bump breaks the build, not because of the old base. The Lint log shows oxc API errors: `StaticPropertyName` no longer implements `to_string`, and `Option<&str>` isn't `Display`. It needs code changes, so I'd leave it for a separate task.\n\n**Not verified:** the fork ran `cargo test --no-run` only on an earlier stack top, not on the final heads. CI will show any break.\n\nPlease wait for checks to finish on #232 and #252 before merging."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":695,"cache_read_input_tokens":306765,"output_tokens":917,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":695,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":917,"cache_read_input_tokens":306765,"cache_creation_input_tokens":695,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":695},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"0429e354-3f26-4f6b-8f23-1d996aa25918","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgTsPNAbeYb647yEabCeP","requestRef":"68afac11-e351-427a-a0bd-abbc4ded2113","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"26b86864-4fb9-4c06-870b-0089228d99fc","timestamp":"2026-10-28T02:46:10.367Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","sessionId":"b