{"type":"bridge-session","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","bridgeSessionId":"cse_01D7CJmXuD2ASqfBYm7Lk4WZ","lastSequenceNum":21749,"ownerAccountUuid":"138d593e-e185-4f72-89f2-82e1a501f134","ownerOrganizationUuid":"602db9b4-428d-49e6-a99c-64152cc62a79"}
{"parentUuid":"4b093770-a9b7-4fb6-91d8-c9e8599fe668","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgTweYScfzPCojuf17VmC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"#248 can't be fixed by rebasing: the bump needs code changes, and a fork is making them.\n\n- **What breaks:** OXC 0.155 changes its API, for example `StaticPropertyName` no longer has `to_string` and `Option<&str>` isn't `Display`. Lint, tests, Coverage and MSRV fail on those errors.\n- **The fix:**\n  - A new PR on `deps/oxc-0.155` applies the same bump and adapts our code to 0.155, based on the release notes rather than guesswork.\n  - It runs the real gates: build, core tests (snapshots must not change without a reason), clippy, fmt, MSRV, Coverage and the Vite plugin test.\n  - It checks speed and memory on Mantine and Chakra against `main`, so a new parser version can't slip a regression in.\n- **Stacking:** before pushing it trial-merges against the open PRs. If it overlaps files they touch, it stacks on #244's branch, not on `main`.\n- **Commits:** signed, and it doesn't force-push or merge.\n- **After it's green,** it will tell you whether to close #248, since dependabot keeps rebasing it. It will also recommend a dependabot setting for OXC, because every pre-1.0 minor can break. It won't edit `dependabot.yml` without asking you.\n\nI'll report when it finishes."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2129,"cache_read_input_tokens":312023,"output_tokens":449,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2129,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":449,"cache_read_input_tokens":312023,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2129,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2129},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"c52979f2-06ab-46b6-91cd-4a121aa5c0d0","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgTweY8XNYbk5W5aZA93Z","requestRef":"d0671245-9c23-4963-998e-a7aaf71bd845","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"4d48bd11-329e-4ddc-af7b-91f35888247a","timestamp":"2026-10-28T03:42:01.038Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/release-0.2.0","sessionId":"ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675","version":"2.1.308","gitBranch":"chore/empty-allow-list","slug":"purring-snuggling-matsumoto"}
